00:42:00.400 --> 00:42:05.480
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: empower our local governments toward fiscal independence, and navigate our public sector debt.

asr-000677
00:42:06.460 --> 00:42:10.720
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: As emphasized in the President's Budget Message for Fiscal Year 2027,

asr-000678
00:42:11.400 --> 00:42:15.800
