asr-000680
00:42:22.520 --> 00:42:28.880
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: The government is working hard to meet the projected national revenue of 5.21 trillion pesos,

asr-000681
00:42:29.480 --> 00:42:34.800
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: equivalent to 15.7% of GDP in 2027.

asr-000682
00:42:34.800 --> 00:42:40.760
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mr. Speaker, this aggressive revenue mobilization is essential to our fiscal consolidation strategy,

asr-000683
00:42:41.360 --> 00:42:51.800
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: which seeks to deliberately reduce our national deficit from 5.4% of GDP in 2026 to 5.1% in 2027.

asr-000684
00:42:52.520 --> 00:42:56.840
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: and steadily down to 3.49% by 2030.

asr-000685
00:42:57.560 --> 00:43:02.520
