asr-003164
03:00:37.300 --> 03:00:44.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: E.O. 338 cannot be invoked to disregard Section 11 of Republic Act 7722.

asr-003165
03:00:46.260 --> 03:00:52.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: If the required portfolio management arrangement has been displaced, that is non-compliance with the law.

asr-003166
