Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: walang laman,

asr-005870
05:24:01.880 --> 05:24:03.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: walang nutrisyon.

asr-005871
05:24:03.880 --> 05:24:04.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah,

asr-005872
05:24:04.880 --> 05:24:05.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi po,

asr-005873
05:24:05.880 --> 05:24:10.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

asr-005874
05:24:10.880 --> 05:24:12.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: junk calories,

asr-005875
05:24:12.880 --> 05:24:13.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: known as empty calories.

asr-005876
05:24:13.880 --> 05:24:18.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Energy from foods that provide high amounts of calories.

asr-005877
05:24:18.880 --> 05:24:19.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes?

asr-005878
05:24:19.880 --> 05:24:21.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mostly from added sugar,

asr-005879
05:24:21.880 --> 05:24:22.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: solid fats,

asr-005880
05:24:22.880 --> 05:24:24.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and refined carbohydrates.

asr-005881
05:24:24.880 --> 05:24:28.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: While offering little to no essential nutrients

asr-005882
05:24:28.880 --> 05:24:29.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: like protein,

asr-005883
05:24:29.880 --> 05:24:30.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: fiber,

asr-005884
05:24:30.880 --> 05:24:31.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: vitamins,

asr-005885
05:24:31.880 --> 05:24:32.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or minerals.

asr-005886
05:24:32.880 --> 05:24:34.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No? Ang gusto ko lang po sabihin,

asr-005887
05:24:34.880 --> 05:24:35.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na,

asr-005888
05:24:35.880 --> 05:24:36.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

asr-005889
05:24:36.880 --> 05:24:37.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: this is an analogy.

asr-005890
05:24:37.880 --> 05:24:38.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005891
05:24:38.880 --> 05:24:39.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, totoo,

asr-005892
05:24:39.880 --> 05:24:41.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: merong economic growth.

asr-005893
05:24:41.880 --> 05:24:42.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No? Pero, ah, ah,

asr-005894
