Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there are different kinds of growth.

asr-005895
05:24:45.880 --> 05:24:48.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No? Merong growth na talagang lumilikha

asr-005896
05:24:48.880 --> 05:24:50.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mas maraming trabaho.

asr-005897
05:24:50.880 --> 05:24:51.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah,

asr-005898
05:24:51.880 --> 05:24:52.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nagpapaangat.

asr-005899
05:24:52.880 --> 05:24:54.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah,

asr-005900
05:24:54.880 --> 05:24:56.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pang matagalang nagpapaangat

asr-005901
05:24:56.880 --> 05:24:57.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa mamamayan,

asr-005902
05:24:57.880 --> 05:24:58.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa kahirapan.

asr-005903
05:24:58.880 --> 05:24:59.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005904
05:24:59.880 --> 05:25:01.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nakabatay sa,

asr-005905
05:25:01.880 --> 05:25:02.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

asr-005906
05:25:02.880 --> 05:25:04.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: paglikha ng trabaho.

asr-005907
05:25:04.880 --> 05:25:06.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa agrikultura,

asr-005908
05:25:06.880 --> 05:25:07.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa industriya.

asr-005909
05:25:07.880 --> 05:25:08.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005910
05:25:08.880 --> 05:25:09.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At siguro masasabi natin,

asr-005911
05:25:09.880 --> 05:25:11.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ganyan ang nakikita natin sa ating mga kapitbahay.

asr-005912
05:25:11.880 --> 05:25:12.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya naiiwan na tayo.

asr-005913
05:25:12.880 --> 05:25:13.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Notably, for example,

asr-005914
05:25:13.880 --> 05:25:14.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Vietnam,

asr-005915
05:25:16.500 --> 05:25:18.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which is driven by

asr-005916
05:25:18.740 --> 05:25:20.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: manufacturing.

asr-005917
05:25:20.340 --> 05:25:21.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No? Ah,

asr-005919
05:25:21.440 --> 05:25:23.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: growth in their manufacturing,

asr-005920
05:25:23.200 --> 05:25:23.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah,

asr-005921
05:25:23.640 --> 05:25:26.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: matagal nang naiwanan tayo sa agrikultura.

asr-005922
05:25:26.920 --> 05:25:27.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005923
05:25:27.300 --> 05:25:29.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya nga nag-i-import tayo

asr-005924
05:25:29.200 --> 05:25:30.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng bigas sa kanila.

asr-005925
05:25:30.620 --> 05:25:31.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun yung

asr-005926
05:25:31.780 --> 05:25:32.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: isang tipo ng growth.

asr-005927
05:25:32.960 --> 05:25:34.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron namang isang tipo ng growth,

asr-005928
05:25:34.960 --> 05:25:36.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na,

asr-005929
05:25:36.340 --> 05:25:37.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tawagin natin,

asr-005930
05:25:37.460 --> 05:25:38.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung may junk calories,

asr-005931
05:25:38.480 --> 05:25:39.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron ding junk growth.

asr-005932
05:25:39.700 --> 05:25:41.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005942
05:25:41.020 --> 05:25:41.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Totoo,

asr-005943
05:25:41.760 --> 05:25:42.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the headline figures

asr-005944
05:25:42.960 --> 05:25:44.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: will increase,

asr-005945
05:25:44.900 --> 05:25:46.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi na bawasan daw ang mahirap,

asr-005946
05:25:46.880 --> 05:25:47.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: no,

asr-005947
05:25:47.880 --> 05:25:48.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero sa totoo lang,

asr-005948
05:25:48.880 --> 05:25:52.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung tatanungin mo ang ordinaryong mamamayan,

asr-005949
05:25:52.880 --> 05:25:53.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

asr-005950
05:25:53.880 --> 05:25:54.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: di nila na-ra-ramdaman

asr-005951
05:25:54.880 --> 05:25:56.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang pagiging middle income status,

asr-005952
05:25:56.880 --> 05:25:57.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: no,

asr-005953
05:25:57.880 --> 05:25:59.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bakit hindi?

asr-005954
05:25:59.880 --> 05:26:00.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil,

asr-005955
05:26:00.880 --> 05:26:02.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: napataas

asr-005956
05:26:02.880 --> 05:26:03.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang,

asr-005957
05:26:03.880 --> 05:26:04.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah,

asr-005958
05:26:04.880 --> 05:26:05.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o napababa daw ang poverty rate,

asr-005959
05:26:05.880 --> 05:26:07.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil sa ayuda.

asr-005960
05:26:07.880 --> 05:26:08.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil sa tupad,

asr-005961
05:26:08.880 --> 05:26:09.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: napaba,

asr-005962
05:26:09.880 --> 05:26:10.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: napaba-

asr-005963
05:26:10.880 --> 05:26:14.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pababa ang unemployment rate.

asr-005964
05:26:14.880 --> 05:26:18.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero hindi naman lumikha ng pangmatagalang trabaho,

asr-005965
05:26:19.020 --> 05:26:23.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi lumikha ng livelihood o kabuhayan,

asr-005966
05:26:23.680 --> 05:26:24.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung hindi ayuda.

asr-005967
05:26:25.500 --> 05:26:28.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, to conclude, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005968
05:26:28.720 --> 05:26:31.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: unfortunately, the current model

asr-005969
05:26:31.340 --> 05:26:35.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pursued by the Marcos Jr. administration,

asr-005970
05:26:36.560 --> 05:26:39.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: led by the economic managers,

asr-005971
05:26:39.460 --> 05:26:41.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including the Department of Finance,

asr-005972
05:26:42.840 --> 05:26:47.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: has been a debt-driven junk growth.

asr-005973
05:26:48.280 --> 05:26:54.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi lumilika ng pangmatagalang trabaho at kabuhayan,

asr-005974
05:26:54.500 --> 05:26:57.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: lalo na sa agrikultura at industriya.

asr-005975
05:26:58.280 --> 05:27:08.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakadepende sa pagwaldas ng malaking public funds

asr-005976
05:27:08.100 --> 05:27:09.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa

asr-005977
05:27:09.140 --> 05:27:12.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: public infrastructure,

asr-005978
05:27:12.760 --> 05:27:16.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: katulad ng flood control na hindi tunay na pakikinabangan ng mamamayan

asr-005979
05:27:16.540 --> 05:27:20.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at pinagbumulan ng malaking corruption

asr-005980
05:27:20.360 --> 05:27:21.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at

asr-005981
05:27:21.580 --> 05:27:23.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ayuda,

asr-005982
05:27:24.640 --> 05:27:25.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: paglaki ng ayuda

asr-005983
05:27:25.760 --> 05:27:30.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na pansamantalang magbibigay ng tulong,

asr-005984
05:27:30.520 --> 05:27:34.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ngunit hindi ng pangmatagalang trabaho at kabuhayan sa mamamayan.

asr-005985
05:27:34.920 --> 05:27:37.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hanggang doon na lamang po, Madam Speaker,

asr-005986
05:27:39.140 --> 05:27:41.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan ang kailangang baguhin sa kasalukuyang budget.

asr-005987
05:27:42.320 --> 05:27:44.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At hindi lang budget ang kailangang baguhin,

asr-005988
05:27:44.160 --> 05:27:46.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kailangang baguhin yung buong economic model.

asr-005989
05:27:47.300 --> 05:27:48.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi na po pwede

asr-005990
05:27:48.280 --> 05:27:50.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang debt-driven,

asr-005991
05:27:51.500 --> 05:27:55.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pork-fueled,

asr-005992
05:27:55.520 --> 05:27:56.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: debt-driven,

asr-005993
05:27:57.540 --> 05:27:59.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: debt-fueled,

asr-005994
05:27:59.100 --> 05:28:00.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pork-driven

asr-005995
05:28:00.040 --> 05:28:01.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: economic growth

asr-005996
05:28:01.860 --> 05:28:03.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na nakikita natin ngayon.

asr-005997
05:28:03.440 --> 05:28:04.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat po.

asr-005998
05:28:06.820 --> 05:28:07.860
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Maraming salamat,

asr-005999
05:28:08.160 --> 05:28:09.100
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mrs. Madam Speaker,

asr-006000
05:28:09.140 --> 05:28:10.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-006001
05:28:12.520 --> 05:28:13.760
Rep. Patricia C. Calderon: Madam Speaker,

asr-006002
05:28:14.000 --> 05:28:15.580
Rep. Patricia C. Calderon: next to interpolate the sponsor,

asr-006003
05:28:15.740 --> 05:28:19.380
Rep. Patricia C. Calderon: I move to recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus

asr-006004
05:28:19.380 --> 05:28:21.560
Rep. Patricia C. Calderon: of Philreca Partylist.

asr-006005
05:28:22.280 --> 05:28:25.660
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Presley De Jesus of Partylist Philreca

asr-006006
05:28:25.660 --> 05:28:28.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: is recognized for his interpolation.

asr-006007
05:28:29.520 --> 05:28:31.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

asr-006008
05:28:31.680 --> 05:28:32.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Of course, the

asr-006009
05:28:32.420 --> 05:28:33.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: distinguished sponsor,

asr-006010
05:28:34.680 --> 05:28:35.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: medyo limang oras na siya,

asr-006011
05:28:36.120 --> 05:28:37.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: so I'll make it short.

asr-006012
05:28:38.260 --> 05:28:39.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Speaker,

asr-006013
05:28:39.140 --> 05:28:40.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006014
05:28:40.480 --> 05:28:41.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: again,

asr-006015
05:28:42.020 --> 05:28:44.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: being representative of all the cooperatives,

asr-006016
05:28:44.460 --> 05:28:44.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ito po,

asr-006017
05:28:44.880 --> 05:28:46.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ito yung sa mga kooperatiba po,

asr-006018
05:28:46.540 --> 05:28:48.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have only a few questions.

asr-006019
05:28:49.440 --> 05:28:50.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ang una pong tanong,

asr-006020
05:28:50.960 --> 05:28:52.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ano ho ang primary reason

asr-006021
05:28:52.900 --> 05:28:55.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: bakit hirap na hirap makakuha

asr-006022
05:28:55.360 --> 05:28:56.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: o mag-renew,

asr-006023
05:28:57.000 --> 05:28:58.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: mag-renew ng CTE

asr-006024
05:28:58.200 --> 05:29:01.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ang mga cooperatives natin?

asr-006025
05:29:03.600 --> 05:29:06.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito po yung Certificate of Tax Exemption.

asr-006037
05:29:51.240 --> 05:29:59.020
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, sa una po, nire-require po talaga natin yung tax, yung TIN number po nila.

asr-006038
05:30:00.000 --> 05:30:03.600
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Pero sa ngayon ay may mga adjustments po ang ginagawa ngayon ng BIR.

asr-006039
05:30:03.800 --> 05:30:06.940
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Nakakapag-renew naman po sila as part of the ease of doing business.

asr-006040
05:30:07.520 --> 05:30:10.000
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Kaya hindi na po natin nire-require yung kanilang...

asr-006041
05:30:11.660 --> 05:30:17.900
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Hindi na po ngayon in-strictly enforce yung requirement po ng pag-submit niya kanila ng TIN.

asr-006042
05:30:17.980 --> 05:30:20.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Alam niyo po, Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-006043
05:30:21.140 --> 05:30:27.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Karamihan po sa mga small kooperativa, yung mga magsasaka, alalayo ng lugar niyan.

asr-006044
05:30:27.620 --> 05:30:31.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, alam niyo, karamihan sa kanila, no read, no write.

asr-006045
05:30:31.300 --> 05:30:36.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, pag pumunta sa bayan niyan, baka pagtawanan sila, hindi nga nilanam kung ano ibig sabihin ng TIN.

asr-006046
05:30:37.000 --> 05:30:41.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, yung sa amin po, konting unawa sa kanila.

asr-006047
05:30:41.780 --> 05:30:45.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But again, I know, sa BIR, kailangan talaga may TIN ka.

asr-006048
05:30:46.020 --> 05:30:50.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi nga, identifier yan, para ka lang kumuha din ng national ID.

asr-006049
05:30:50.780 --> 05:30:51.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, you need that.

asr-006050
05:30:51.460 --> 05:30:56.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But again, pag isa bang cooperative ang maliit, natin ka malalayong lugar,

asr-006051
05:30:56.400 --> 05:31:01.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: eh ang kanyang kooperativa, kung nyari, kooperativa ABC,

asr-006052
05:31:02.420 --> 05:31:05.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: di ba yun lang ang dapat i-registro, hindi yung mga member niya.

asr-006053
05:31:05.140 --> 05:31:06.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pati ba member, kailangan i-registro?

asr-006054
05:31:08.220 --> 05:31:13.700
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Sa ngayon, kaya nga po sabihin ng BIR ngayon, hindi naman siya strictly in-enforce na ngayon.

asr-006055
05:31:13.820 --> 05:31:22.520
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Kasi nga, nakiki, minsan nakikipag-deal na lang po sila doon sa kooperativa kung saan miyembro itong mga individuals na po ito.

asr-006056
05:31:23.280 --> 05:31:26.180
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So, again, ang BIR.

asr-006057
05:31:26.400 --> 05:31:29.860
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Nais naman po talaga maintindihan ng kalagayan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006058
05:31:30.420 --> 05:31:34.460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Ngunit, kailangan din po balansin ang BIR doon sa pangangailangan ng batas kung saan.

asr-006059
05:31:35.020 --> 05:31:44.440
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Iri-require po ng batas ang ating BIR na mag-request po ng TIN as part of the compliance, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006060
05:31:44.440 --> 05:31:53.300
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Kaya nga po sila, ina-adjust nga po nila, not strictly enforced, kasi naintindihan din po nila yung kalagayan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-006061
05:31:53.420 --> 05:31:55.840
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: And directly dealing with the cooperatives.

asr-006062
05:31:56.400 --> 05:32:02.440
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Rather than the previous implementation that individual members should have to produce the TIN number, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-006063
05:32:02.900 --> 05:32:04.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

asr-006064
05:32:05.180 --> 05:32:12.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is there any time that you just review it, you know, for the sake of argument?

asr-006065
05:32:12.280 --> 05:32:18.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Para naman makita at marinig nila na talagang gumagawa po ang kanilang kooperativa at the same time,

asr-006066
05:32:18.520 --> 05:32:21.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the BIR will adjust para naman sa kanila.

asr-006067
05:32:21.280 --> 05:32:24.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: To make sure na talaga naman lahat tayo ay binibigay.

asr-006068
05:32:24.300 --> 05:32:25.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I know that the BIR...

asr-006069
05:32:26.400 --> 05:32:29.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bread and butter natin is BIR talaga.

asr-006070
05:32:29.360 --> 05:32:34.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's why I salute and I always approve your budget.

asr-006071
