Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi alam ko, matagal na kayo, kaya ayoko narikipano.

asr-006225
05:41:23.460 --> 05:41:25.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sana, huwag na kayo magpala...

asr-006226
05:41:25.460 --> 05:41:27.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sulatan nyo sila.

asr-006227
05:41:27.460 --> 05:41:29.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Huwag nyo na silang i-raid.

asr-006228
05:41:29.460 --> 05:41:31.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nire-raid nyo. Mga legal naman yan, eh.

asr-006229
05:41:31.460 --> 05:41:33.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nagre-raid kayo.

asr-006230
05:41:33.460 --> 05:41:35.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nagtataka ko ba't i-raid? Pwede naman silang puntahan.

asr-006231
05:41:35.460 --> 05:41:37.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Huwag nyo silang tatakutin.

asr-006232
05:41:37.460 --> 05:41:40.460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Bumibisita po ang BIR sa mga cockpit, ano.

asr-006233
05:41:40.460 --> 05:41:43.460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So wala pong raid. O, makakaasa po sila

asr-006234
05:41:43.460 --> 05:41:45.460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: na makikipag-ugnayan po. Yes po.

asr-006235
05:41:45.460 --> 05:41:47.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: They are welcome, but huwag nyo i-re-raid.

asr-006236
05:41:47.460 --> 05:41:49.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ipapasara ka agad. Eh, tingnan nyo muna.

asr-006237
05:41:49.460 --> 05:41:51.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi wala kayong guidelines, eh.

asr-006238
05:41:51.460 --> 05:41:53.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Unang-una, walang guidelines ang BIR.

asr-006239
05:41:53.460 --> 05:41:55.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pagdating diyan. No?

asr-006240
05:41:55.460 --> 05:41:57.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So sana naman, maayos natin ito.

asr-006241
05:41:57.460 --> 05:41:59.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi willing silang magbayad.

asr-006242
05:41:59.460 --> 05:42:01.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Willing naman. Lahat naman ito mapag-anoan.

asr-006243
05:42:01.460 --> 05:42:06.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Anyway, the next time na you already have a technical working group,

asr-006244
05:42:06.460 --> 05:42:10.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ay sana maayos natin lahat ito.

asr-006245
05:42:10.460 --> 05:42:12.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Lahat naman dapat kumita.

asr-006246
05:42:12.460 --> 05:42:15.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kaganyan sinasabi ko, BIR...

asr-006247
05:42:15.460 --> 05:42:17.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bread and butter. But again,

asr-006248
