Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron pong labing-anim na lungsod, ang hindi nakatanggap.

asr-006533
06:15:00.000 --> 06:15:10.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At meron pong na higit 300 mga munisipyo ang hindi nakatanggap mula sa LGSF-PALGO.

asr-006534
06:15:12.380 --> 06:15:13.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito na po ang tanong ko.

asr-006535
06:15:16.480 --> 06:15:22.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang aking mga tanong ay hindi tungkol sa kung kailangan ng mga LGU ng tulong. Kailangan nila ito.

asr-006536
06:15:22.420 --> 06:15:34.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang tunay na tanong ay sino ang may kapangyarihang magpasya kung aling LGU, anong proyekto, magkano ang matatanggap, at kailan ito ibibigay?

asr-006537
06:15:35.000 --> 06:15:38.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kongreso ba? O ang Executive Department?

asr-006538
06:15:47.480 --> 06:15:50.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006539
06:15:50.040 --> 06:15:52.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So yung release po ng local...

asr-006540
06:15:52.420 --> 06:15:59.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Local Government Support Fund, in general, is governed by the special provision as approved by Congress in the GAA.

asr-006541
06:16:00.000 --> 06:16:15.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: After that, the DBM is the one authorized to take care of the processing from the point of receiving the requests from the local government units up to the point of evaluating and releasing.

asr-006542
06:16:15.680 --> 06:16:22.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mahalaga po dito siguro na ipunto na nakadepende din po yung release.

asr-006543
06:16:22.420 --> 06:16:28.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ito ang mga authorization na DBM, base po sa mga requests ng mga local government units.

asr-006544
06:16:28.120 --> 06:16:38.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So halimbawa po, sinicheck po namin yung ilan po sa mga nabanggit ng mga probinsya na ating distinguished colleague, whether they had requests.

asr-006545
06:16:38.500 --> 06:16:40.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, ma'am. Okay na po. Maliwalag po.

asr-006546
06:16:40.420 --> 06:16:41.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, ang Executive Department po.

asr-006547
06:16:43.040 --> 06:16:45.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That is correct po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006548
06:16:45.680 --> 06:16:52.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung wala, masasabi ba ng Kongreso na sa araw ng pagboto natin sa budget,

asr-006549
06:16:52.420 --> 06:16:55.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung sino talaga yung makakatanggap

asr-006550
06:16:55.260 --> 06:16:56.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng mga LGUs?

asr-006551
06:16:58.240 --> 06:17:01.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: On the day that we approve our GAA,

asr-006552
06:17:01.820 --> 06:17:04.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: masasabi ba natin kung sino yung mga LGUs

asr-006553
06:17:04.620 --> 06:17:05.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: na makakatanggap?

asr-006554
06:17:09.700 --> 06:17:12.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006555
06:17:12.580 --> 06:17:15.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at the point of approving the GAA

asr-006556
06:17:15.420 --> 06:17:18.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and the H-GAB on our part,

asr-006557
06:17:18.060 --> 06:17:20.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi pa po natin ma-identify.

asr-006558
06:17:20.120 --> 06:17:23.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Qualified po ang lahat ng local government units

asr-006559
06:17:23.340 --> 06:17:26.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na mag-apply po, mag-submitin ang kanilang mga requests.

asr-006560
06:17:27.000 --> 06:17:29.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero kung sino po yung talagang gagawaran

asr-006561
06:17:29.020 --> 06:17:32.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nung mga grant sa ilalim po ng LGSF

asr-006562
06:17:32.220 --> 06:17:34.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa punto po na ating pag-aproba ng H-GAB,

asr-006563
06:17:34.820 --> 06:17:36.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi pa po matutuko yun.

asr-006564
06:17:36.980 --> 06:17:39.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig pong sabi, may karapatan sila mag-apply.

asr-006565
06:17:40.220 --> 06:17:41.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006566
06:17:41.220 --> 06:17:43.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero wala silang karapatan na sigurado makatanggap.

asr-006567
06:17:47.060 --> 06:17:49.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Depende po sa evaluation po

asr-006568
06:17:49.360 --> 06:17:49.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng

asr-006569
06:17:50.120 --> 06:17:50.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: DBM. Opo.

asr-006570
06:17:51.600 --> 06:17:53.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Masasabi ba natin kung magkano

asr-006571
06:17:53.180 --> 06:17:55.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang para sa tubig, para sa ospital,

asr-006572
06:17:55.180 --> 06:17:57.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: para sa kalsada, stadium, ayuda, scholarship,

asr-006573
06:17:58.180 --> 06:17:59.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: o lahat ng mga items

asr-006574
06:17:59.960 --> 06:18:02.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: na nakalagay po sa guidelines.

asr-006575
06:18:02.800 --> 06:18:04.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madi-determine ba natin

asr-006576
06:18:04.080 --> 06:18:05.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa pag-aaproba ng budget

asr-006577
06:18:05.380 --> 06:18:08.500
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung mga magkano at sino yung mga makakatanggap?

asr-006578
06:18:09.400 --> 06:18:10.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006579
06:18:10.660 --> 06:18:12.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at the point of approving the budget,

asr-006580
06:18:12.300 --> 06:18:12.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi pa po.

asr-006581
06:18:13.080 --> 06:18:16.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi nakadepende po sa klase ng proyekto

asr-006582
06:18:16.160 --> 06:18:18.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na i-dequest po ng iba't-ibang mga

asr-006583
06:18:18.140 --> 06:18:19.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: local government units.

asr-006584
06:18:20.120 --> 06:18:21.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pangalawa po, ang project menu ba

asr-006585
06:18:21.880 --> 06:18:23.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay may tunay na limitasyon.

asr-006586
06:18:31.280 --> 06:18:33.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pagdating po, kung ang limitasyon po

asr-006587
06:18:33.220 --> 06:18:35.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na tinutukay po ng ating

asr-006588
06:18:35.180 --> 06:18:37.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague, Madam Speaker,

asr-006589
06:18:37.200 --> 06:18:39.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay yung klase ng mga proyekto

asr-006590
06:18:39.380 --> 06:18:41.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na qualified po sa ilalim na

asr-006591
06:18:41.600 --> 06:18:43.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: LGSF, meron po.

asr-006592
06:18:43.380 --> 06:18:45.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sapagkat kung titignan po natin

asr-006593
06:18:45.120 --> 06:18:47.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang General Appropriations Act,

asr-006594
06:18:47.920 --> 06:18:49.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dun sa ilalim po ng special provision,

asr-006595
06:18:50.120 --> 06:18:51.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa ilalim ng Local Government Support Fund,

asr-006596
06:18:52.160 --> 06:18:53.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nakadetalye po yun, isa-isa,

asr-006597
06:18:54.420 --> 06:18:57.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung menu ng kung ano-anong klaseng

asr-006598
06:18:57.320 --> 06:18:59.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga proyekto yung pwede pong i-request

asr-006599
06:18:59.500 --> 06:19:01.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga local government units.

asr-006600
06:19:02.120 --> 06:19:03.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kaya nga po, ibig sabihin,

asr-006601
06:19:03.140 --> 06:19:04.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pwede yung agricultural programs,

asr-006602
06:19:04.760 --> 06:19:05.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: nakalagay po yun.

asr-006603
06:19:06.140 --> 06:19:06.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-006604
06:19:06.980 --> 06:19:08.720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede po yung farm-to-market roads.

asr-006605
06:19:09.140 --> 06:19:09.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-006606
06:19:09.960 --> 06:19:11.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede yung fish ports at water systems.

asr-006607
06:19:13.300 --> 06:19:14.720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede yung cultural heritage.

asr-006608
06:19:15.000 --> 06:19:16.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede yung ICT, CCTV,

asr-006609
06:19:16.860 --> 06:19:19.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: local roads, bridges, public markets,

asr-006610
06:19:20.120 --> 06:19:21.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: purpose halls at buildings,

asr-006611
06:19:21.900 --> 06:19:23.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sports stadium, hospital,

asr-006612
06:19:23.960 --> 06:19:26.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: evacuation center, public cemeteries,

asr-006613
06:19:26.280 --> 06:19:28.060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: parks and plazas, medical equipment,

asr-006614
06:19:28.420 --> 06:19:30.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: materials recovery, disaster equipment,

asr-006615
06:19:30.640 --> 06:19:32.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ambulances, multi-purpose vehicle,

asr-006616
06:19:32.840 --> 06:19:34.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: daycare facilities, RICE,

asr-006617
06:19:34.280 --> 06:19:36.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: medical funeral, transportation,

asr-006618
06:19:36.620 --> 06:19:39.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: food, cash assistance, educational assistance,

asr-006619
06:19:39.420 --> 06:19:40.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: housing repair materials.

asr-006620
06:19:43.160 --> 06:19:45.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang ito na po yung buong trabaho

asr-006621
06:19:45.100 --> 06:19:46.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng national government.

asr-006622
06:19:46.080 --> 06:19:48.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang lahat ng departamento

asr-006623
06:19:48.200 --> 06:19:49.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay nasasakot na.

asr-006624
06:19:49.340 --> 06:19:51.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nang palgo.

asr-006625
06:19:51.500 --> 06:19:52.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tama po ba?

asr-006626
06:19:53.500 --> 06:19:55.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro confidential funds

asr-006627
06:19:55.000 --> 06:19:57.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at intelligence funds na lang wala dito.

asr-006628
06:19:58.180 --> 06:19:58.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006629
06:19:59.140 --> 06:19:59.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: distinguished colleague,

asr-006630
06:20:00.140 --> 06:20:01.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang dahilan po kung bakit magandito

asr-006631
06:20:01.740 --> 06:20:05.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sapagkat bagamat meron po tayong mga

asr-006632
06:20:05.040 --> 06:20:07.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nakapondo sa ilalim po

asr-006633
06:20:07.720 --> 06:20:09.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga national government agencies

asr-006634
06:20:09.680 --> 06:20:11.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa mga nabanggit

asr-006635
06:20:11.680 --> 06:20:13.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga klase ng mga proyekto,

asr-006636
06:20:13.860 --> 06:20:15.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may mga pagkakataon po kasi

asr-006637
06:20:15.100 --> 06:20:16.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na kinukulang pa rin po

asr-006638
06:20:16.680 --> 06:20:19.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung mga umaabot sa mga local government.

asr-006639
06:20:19.040 --> 06:20:22.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon po pumapasok yung FALGU,

asr-006640
06:20:22.340 --> 06:20:23.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Financial Assistance

asr-006641
06:20:23.340 --> 06:20:24.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa Local Government Units,

asr-006642
06:20:24.680 --> 06:20:25.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Growth Equity Fund,

asr-006643
06:20:26.260 --> 06:20:28.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Support to Barangay Development,

asr-006644
06:20:28.740 --> 06:20:30.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at yung iba't-ibang klase pa po

asr-006645
06:20:30.160 --> 06:20:31.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng Local Government Support Fund

asr-006646
06:20:31.920 --> 06:20:33.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po ma-augment

asr-006647
06:20:33.100 --> 06:20:35.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung kung ano man po yung hindi pa

asr-006648
06:20:35.300 --> 06:20:37.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kayang i-cover

asr-006649
06:20:37.080 --> 06:20:39.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong mga national government agencies.

asr-006650
06:20:39.440 --> 06:20:41.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung ganyan po ang ating katwiran,

asr-006651
06:20:41.560 --> 06:20:42.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker,

asr-006652
06:20:42.840 --> 06:20:44.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: bakit yung mayayamang LGU

asr-006653
06:20:44.360 --> 06:20:45.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung nakikinabang?

asr-006654
06:20:45.880 --> 06:20:47.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Di ba support to LGU?

asr-006655
06:20:47.520 --> 06:20:48.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit nasusuportahan?

asr-006656
06:20:49.040 --> 06:20:51.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung mayayaman na halos hindi na kailangan ng tulong

asr-006657
06:20:51.320 --> 06:20:54.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at hindi nasusuportahan yung mga pinakamahirap,

asr-006658
06:20:54.840 --> 06:20:56.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yan po ang data.

asr-006659
06:20:56.860 --> 06:20:58.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi naman mapapasilungalingan ang data.

asr-006660
06:21:04.880 --> 06:21:07.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006661
06:21:07.760 --> 06:21:10.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: opo, sumasang-ayon po ako sa punto

asr-006662
06:21:10.040 --> 06:21:12.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng ating Distinguished Colleague

asr-006663
06:21:12.360 --> 06:21:14.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na in theory po,

asr-006664
06:21:14.820 --> 06:21:17.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dapat yung mga malalaking mga syudad,

asr-006665
06:21:17.900 --> 06:21:20.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: dapat yung mga highly-urbanized cities

asr-006666
06:21:20.120 --> 06:21:21.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay may sapat na pondo

asr-006667
06:21:21.360 --> 06:21:23.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po i-sustain yung mga pangangailangan

asr-006668
06:21:23.620 --> 06:21:26.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng kanilang sariling lokalidad.

asr-006669
06:21:27.660 --> 06:21:28.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However po,

asr-006670
06:21:29.020 --> 06:21:30.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may mga pagkakataon din po

asr-006671
06:21:30.820 --> 06:21:32.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na kinukulang pa rin po.

asr-006672
06:21:33.520 --> 06:21:34.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po,

asr-006673
06:21:34.640 --> 06:21:36.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kung maaari ko pong banggitin,

asr-006674
06:21:36.420 --> 06:21:37.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006675
06:21:37.220 --> 06:21:39.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi po may pagkakataon.

asr-006676
06:21:39.480 --> 06:21:41.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa lahat ng pagkakataon,

asr-006677
06:21:41.440 --> 06:21:45.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: priority yung mga mayayamang LGUs.

asr-006678
06:21:45.900 --> 06:21:47.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yan po yung data eh.

asr-006679
06:21:47.900 --> 06:21:49.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung pinakamayayaman,

asr-006680
06:21:49.440 --> 06:21:50.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yun ang pinakamalalaki.

asr-006681
06:21:51.100 --> 06:21:52.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006682
06:21:52.820 --> 06:21:54.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung ipinakita pong datos kanina

asr-006683
06:21:54.820 --> 06:21:57.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay patungkol po sa FALGO,

asr-006684
06:21:57.300 --> 06:21:58.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung Financial Assistance

asr-006685
06:21:58.280 --> 06:21:59.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to Local Government Units.

asr-006686
06:22:00.000 --> 06:22:02.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kalahati po noong pondo

asr-006687
06:22:02.020 --> 06:22:04.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na nai-release sa ilalim ng FALGO

asr-006688
06:22:04.380 --> 06:22:08.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay related po doon sa tinatawag natin

asr-006689
06:22:08.260 --> 06:22:10.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na rice distribution.

asr-006690
06:22:10.480 --> 06:22:11.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yan po yung 2026.

asr-006691
06:22:11.900 --> 06:22:13.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero sa 2025 po,

asr-006692
06:22:14.460 --> 06:22:15.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ganun din po.

asr-006693
06:22:15.240 --> 06:22:16.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung pinakamayayaman,

asr-006694
06:22:16.860 --> 06:22:17.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yun, yung nabigyan.

asr-006695
06:22:17.900 --> 06:22:22.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Apo, we will check po,

asr-006696
06:22:22.180 --> 06:22:24.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but we recognize the point po,

asr-006697
06:22:24.240 --> 06:22:24.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006698
06:22:25.440 --> 06:22:26.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006699
06:22:26.520 --> 06:22:27.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang nangyari lang po kasi

asr-006700
06:22:27.540 --> 06:22:30.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong 2026,

asr-006701
06:22:30.240 --> 06:22:31.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: malinaw po yun,

asr-006702
06:22:31.400 --> 06:22:33.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: population-based po kasi yung release

asr-006703
06:22:33.240 --> 06:22:33.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: noong rice,

asr-006704
06:22:34.220 --> 06:22:35.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kaya po mas malaki.

asr-006705
06:22:35.780 --> 06:22:37.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Darating po ako dyan, Madam Speaker.

asr-006706
06:22:38.700 --> 06:22:39.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Halimbawa po,

asr-006707
06:22:39.460 --> 06:22:41.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: bibibigay ako ng isang example.

asr-006708
06:22:42.180 --> 06:22:43.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Maari bang sabay na maging eligible

asr-006709
06:22:43.960 --> 06:22:45.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang isang evacuation center

asr-006710
06:22:45.740 --> 06:22:46.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa isang PIP class

asr-006711
06:22:46.880 --> 06:22:46.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: munisipal?

asr-006712
06:22:47.900 --> 06:22:50.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: O isang stadium

asr-006713
06:22:50.100 --> 06:22:51.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa highly urbanized city?

asr-006714
06:22:52.180 --> 06:22:53.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ngayon, kung magkakasabay

asr-006715
06:22:53.280 --> 06:22:54.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung kanilang request,

asr-006716
06:22:55.180 --> 06:22:56.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pero yung pondo,

asr-006717
06:22:56.840 --> 06:22:57.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sinong priority dito?

asr-006718
06:22:58.600 --> 06:23:01.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung evacuation center

asr-006719
06:23:01.100 --> 06:23:02.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng isang PIP class municipality

asr-006720
06:23:02.800 --> 06:23:05.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: o yung stadium

asr-006721
06:23:05.020 --> 06:23:06.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng isang first class city?

asr-006722
06:23:16.240 --> 06:23:17.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang punto ko po,

asr-006723
06:23:17.580 --> 06:23:18.500
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker,

asr-006724
06:23:19.380 --> 06:23:20.820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hindi ba ang special provision

asr-006725
06:23:20.820 --> 06:23:22.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay nagsasabi lamang

asr-006726
06:23:22.180 --> 06:23:23.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung ano ang maaring pondohan,

asr-006727
06:23:24.820 --> 06:23:26.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ngunit hindi nito sinasabi

asr-006728
06:23:26.440 --> 06:23:28.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung ano ang dapat unahin?

asr-006729
06:23:28.980 --> 06:23:30.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron po bang provision

asr-006730
06:23:30.080 --> 06:23:31.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: na nakalagay doon

asr-006731
06:23:31.540 --> 06:23:33.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kung sino ang dapat unahin?

asr-006732
06:23:33.740 --> 06:23:34.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-006733
06:23:34.660 --> 06:23:35.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006734
06:23:35.620 --> 06:23:36.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: halimbawa po,

asr-006735
06:23:36.460 --> 06:23:37.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: doon po sa halimbawa

asr-006736
06:23:38.200 --> 06:23:39.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na binanggit po

asr-006737
06:23:39.180 --> 06:23:40.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng ating Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006738
06:23:40.840 --> 06:23:41.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kung meron pong isang

asr-006739
06:23:41.860 --> 06:23:43.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: highly urbanized city

asr-006740
06:23:43.160 --> 06:23:44.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at isa pong halimbawa

asr-006741
06:23:44.560 --> 06:23:46.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: fourth or fifth class municipality

asr-006742
06:23:46.860 --> 06:23:48.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na sabay na nag-apply,

asr-006743
06:23:49.140 --> 06:23:51.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: maaari po na pareho po silang mabigyan

asr-006744
06:23:51.540 --> 06:23:54.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa ilalim po ng magkaibang programa.

asr-006745
06:23:54.620 --> 06:23:55.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron po tayong tinatawag na

asr-006746
06:23:55.980 --> 06:23:57.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: growth equity fund

asr-006747
06:23:57.240 --> 06:23:59.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa ilalim po ng LGSF

asr-006748
06:23:59.300 --> 06:24:01.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na talaga pong nakatuon

asr-006749
06:24:01.080 --> 06:24:03.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po matugunan yung mga pangangailangan

asr-006750
06:24:03.200 --> 06:24:05.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng fourth and fifth class municipalities.

asr-006751
06:24:05.520 --> 06:24:07.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero sino po magtatakda

asr-006752
06:24:07.020 --> 06:24:08.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng prioritization?

asr-006753
06:24:09.780 --> 06:24:10.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Tinatakba ba ito?

asr-006754
06:24:12.160 --> 06:24:12.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pagkatapos na,

asr-006755
06:24:13.060 --> 06:24:13.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: mapasa ang budget?

asr-006756
06:24:16.860 --> 06:24:17.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Opo,

asr-006757
06:24:17.920 --> 06:24:19.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sapagkat ang nakalagay po

asr-006758
06:24:19.220 --> 06:24:21.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: doon sa special provision natin sa GAA

asr-006759
06:24:21.280 --> 06:24:23.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay nakabase po

asr-006760
06:24:23.300 --> 06:24:25.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa special provision

asr-006761
06:24:25.040 --> 06:24:26.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa criteria po

asr-006762
06:24:26.720 --> 06:24:29.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na i-develop pa

asr-006763
06:24:29.920 --> 06:24:31.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: o bubuoin ng DBM.

asr-006764
06:24:31.440 --> 06:24:32.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, totoo po yun.

asr-006765
06:24:32.600 --> 06:24:33.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung criteria po

asr-006766
06:24:33.740 --> 06:24:34.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for evaluation

asr-006767
06:24:34.660 --> 06:24:36.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay binubuo ng DBM

asr-006768
06:24:36.660 --> 06:24:37.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pagkatapos na po natin

asr-006769
06:24:37.840 --> 06:24:39.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ma-aprobaan yung GAA.

asr-006770
06:24:39.580 --> 06:24:40.360
