asr-007049
06:31:48.100 --> 06:31:52.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa kasalukuyan po, there is no law or there is no provision that,

asr-007050
06:31:52.880 --> 06:31:55.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: particularly bars, such.

asr-007051
06:31:55.420 --> 06:32:03.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So lahat po ng mga local government units ay qualified po na mag-request at mag-apply para po sa LGSF grants.

asr-007052
