asr-007054
06:32:11.100 --> 06:32:17.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede po ba akong mabigyan ng kopya lahat nung nag-apply at lahat nung na-approve at hindi na-approve?

asr-007055
06:32:18.260 --> 06:32:22.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede po ba magbigay sa aking tanggapan ang...

asr-007056
06:32:22.880 --> 06:32:23.320
