asr-007059
06:32:37.100 --> 06:32:38.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 25 and 26.

asr-007060
06:32:39.700 --> 06:32:40.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi naman po madalian.

asr-007061
06:32:41.160 --> 06:32:42.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: One or two weeks, okay naman po yan.

asr-007062
06:32:43.660 --> 06:32:43.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Opo.

asr-007063
06:32:43.940 --> 06:32:51.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sana po may isama yung kanilang ginawang scoring procedure at ranking procedure.

asr-007064
06:32:53.300 --> 06:32:55.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Aprobadong halaga at yung dahilan ng rejection.

asr-007065
