06:33:30.080 --> 06:33:34.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, the DBM will generate what they have.

asr-007069
06:33:34.980 --> 06:33:44.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As of now po, they commit that they will be able to give a list of those who requested, those who were approved, against those who were disapproved.

asr-007070
06:33:44.520 --> 06:33:52.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But as to the reason for the disapproval of every single item po, sisilipin po ng DBM kung meron po sila sa anong level ng datos.

asr-007071
06:33:52.380 --> 06:33:52.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ano lang po?

asr-007072
06:33:52.880 --> 06:33:59.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung veto power po, bago pirmahan ng Pangulo ang GAA, may kapangyarihan siyang ibito.

asr-007073
