Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Maaari bang...

asr-007085
06:34:52.880 --> 06:35:06.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sabihin na sapat na yung congressional oversight para maging kapalit nung Lamsam Appropriations at Discretionary Authority ng DBM dito?

asr-007086
06:35:16.200 --> 06:35:21.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, we're just quickly looking at the reportorial requirements for...

asr-007087
06:35:21.380 --> 06:35:25.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For LGSF, if I may po.

asr-007088
06:35:25.420 --> 06:35:32.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung National Tax Allotment po, meron po itong ano eh, meron siyang definite na mga kriteria.

asr-007089
06:35:33.000 --> 06:35:38.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Population, poverty incidence, income class, fiscal gap, and disaster vulnerability.

asr-007090
06:35:41.020 --> 06:35:41.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker...

asr-007091
06:35:41.700 --> 06:35:42.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Dito po ba merong ganito?

asr-007092
06:35:42.900 --> 06:35:49.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, upon checking po, wala pong reportorial requirements as of now.

asr-007093
06:35:49.760 --> 06:35:51.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa mga nakaraang GAA po.

asr-007094
06:35:51.380 --> 06:35:56.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Wala pong reportorial requirements na talagang nakatoon para po sa LGSF.

asr-007095
06:35:57.380 --> 06:36:08.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero meron pong overall report po na sinusumite yung DBM on a quarterly basis with regard to total disbursements, obligations, and the like.

asr-007096
06:36:08.900 --> 06:36:21.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But again po, upon conferring with the DBM, kung atin pong i-require, maglalagay po tayo sa 2027 na GAA ng reportorial requirements patungkol po.

asr-007097
06:36:21.380 --> 06:36:24.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But again po, sa LGSF, bukas din po ang DBM doon.

asr-007098
06:36:24.720 --> 06:36:25.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

asr-007099
06:36:25.480 --> 06:36:27.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Naniniwala po ako na ang Congress na may power of the...

asr-007100
06:36:27.400 --> 06:36:30.940
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to remind the Honorable [unclear] that his time has [unclear].

asr-007101
06:36:30.940 --> 06:36:31.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, this is my last manifestation.

asr-007102
06:36:32.700 --> 06:36:35.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Naniniwala po ako ang Congress na may power of the first.

asr-007103
06:36:36.460 --> 06:36:41.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasama sa kapangyarihan ito, ang pagpapasya kung anong programa ang pupondohan at kung magkano.

asr-007104
06:36:42.500 --> 06:36:46.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang executive ay dapat magpatupad, hindi gumawa ng bagong appropriation.

asr-007105
06:36:48.100 --> 06:36:50.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang 2027 palgo, hindi tinutukoy...

asr-007106
06:36:51.380 --> 06:36:54.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang 2027 palgo, hindi tinutukoy ng kongreso ang bawat recipient na LGU.

asr-007107
06:36:54.700 --> 06:36:57.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi tinutukoy ng kongreso ang bawat proyekto at lokasyon.

asr-007108
06:36:57.960 --> 06:37:01.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi tinutukoy ng kongreso ang halagang matatanggap ng bawat LGU.

asr-007109
06:37:02.140 --> 06:37:06.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi nagtakda ang kongreso ng mathematical allocation formula.

asr-007110
06:37:06.540 --> 06:37:11.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang DBM pa ang bubuo ng kriteriya pagkatapos o up sa post-enactment.

asr-007111
06:37:12.220 --> 06:37:15.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang DBM ang nag-a-approve ba o tatanggi sa application.

asr-007112
06:37:15.960 --> 06:37:19.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Walang panibagong boto ng kongreso bago ilabas ang pondo.

asr-007113
06:37:21.380 --> 06:37:23.620
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Lahat po ito may public purpose.

asr-007114
06:37:24.340 --> 06:37:34.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero, kinakailangan po talaga dapat ang kongreso at ang implementation lamang po ang ginagawa ng DMA.

asr-007115
06:37:34.960 --> 06:37:40.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Dapat po may guidelines at scorecard na inaprobahan ng kongreso.

asr-007116
06:37:41.460 --> 06:37:44.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pinapayagan ng Supreme Court ang LAMSAM appropriation.

asr-007117
06:37:45.180 --> 06:37:49.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Di lahat ng LAMSAM ay automaticong konstitusyonal.

asr-007118
06:37:51.380 --> 06:37:57.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sapagkat hinihingi ng Korte na identifiable program, activity, or project.

asr-007119
06:37:58.140 --> 06:38:02.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sapat na standards at malinaw na hangganan.

asr-007120
06:38:05.080 --> 06:38:10.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kaya po, palagay ko po ay dapat pag-usapan ng kongreso nito.

asr-007121
06:38:10.400 --> 06:38:20.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro sa BARC, kung paano natin mapoprotektuhan ang palgo na mabigyan talaga ng tulong.

asr-007122
06:38:20.100 --> 06:38:21.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito po ay support.

asr-007123
06:38:21.380 --> 06:38:24.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito po ay support sa local government.

asr-007124
06:38:24.780 --> 06:38:30.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung mayayaman, hindi na gano'ng kailangan ng supporta.

asr-007125
06:38:31.180 --> 06:38:32.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mas kailangan po ng mahihirap.

asr-007126
06:38:33.620 --> 06:38:40.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 22 billion na halaga ng bigas ang pinamigay noong 2026.

asr-007127
06:38:41.280 --> 06:38:47.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito po, wala po itong economic effect sa pagpapaunlad ng bansa.

asr-007128
06:38:47.580 --> 06:38:51.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At alam ko po, bilang matagal na sa paglilingkod

asr-007129
06:38:51.380 --> 06:38:55.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa pamahalaan, marami po, marami dito nanakaw lang.

asr-007130
06:38:56.460 --> 06:38:57.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nanakaw lang po.

asr-007131
06:38:58.020 --> 06:39:11.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala pong absorptive capacity, ang COA, ang DILG, para ma-monitor ang pagbibigay ng 22 billion piso na halaga ng bigas.

asr-007132
06:39:12.180 --> 06:39:18.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sayang po kung sana napagawa ng mga ospital, napagawa ng mga paaralan, nabigay sa mga scholars.

asr-007133
06:39:20.060 --> 06:39:21.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Napakarami pong pangangailangan.

asr-007134
06:39:21.380 --> 06:39:23.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Simple lang po.

