asr-007870
07:12:20.620 --> 07:12:23.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: amount na ito sa kakailanganin.

asr-007871
07:12:23.540 --> 07:12:32.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, we have several options as to how to go about it.

asr-007872
07:12:32.880 --> 07:12:40.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung una po, meron din po tayong contingent fund. Isa pa pong uri ng lump sum funds na pwede din po natin i-access.

asr-007873
07:12:41.020 --> 07:12:49.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron pong isa pa, ilalim po ng bawat ahensya, may iba't iba pong mga programa na maaari din po natin ma-utilize.

asr-007874
07:12:49.540 --> 07:12:58.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But if in case po, wala ng ibang programa sa ibang ahensya na akma doon sa pangangailangan na kailangan po nating respondehan,

asr-007875
07:12:59.140 --> 07:13:02.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we can utilize po the general provision on the use of savings.

asr-007876
07:13:03.240 --> 07:13:13.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So pwede po tayong humiling sa iba't iba mga ahensya na mag-identify ng mga savings na pwede po natin i-revert to the National Treasury

asr-007877
07:13:13.980 --> 07:13:18.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po pwedeng ma-reallocate po doon po sa pangangailangan.

asr-007878
07:13:19.540 --> 07:13:20.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa ibang mga ahensya.

asr-007879
07:13:21.480 --> 07:13:32.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, this representation cannot overemphasize the importance of ensuring that the 2027 budget is an El Niño-ready budget.

asr-007880
07:13:32.820 --> 07:13:37.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we hope that this will be reflected in the final copy of the HGAP.

asr-007881
07:13:38.460 --> 07:13:42.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo sa usapin ulit ng Local Government Support Fund.

asr-007882
07:13:42.840 --> 07:13:49.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung tunay pong para sa bawat bayan ng LGSF, sangayon po ba kayong i-itemize?

asr-007883
07:13:49.540 --> 07:13:51.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito sa GAA for 2027.

asr-007884
07:13:53.060 --> 07:14:01.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Meaning papangalanan po natin ang mga LGU at proyekto na paglalaanan nito kagaya ng ginagawa sa ibang budget line items.

asr-007885
07:14:13.040 --> 07:14:16.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, my apologies po.

asr-007886
07:14:16.660 --> 07:14:18.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May one comment upon the previous response.

asr-007887
07:14:19.540 --> 07:14:25.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I assure po that we will do our best to make sure that the 2027 budget is El Niño-ready.

asr-007888
07:14:26.780 --> 07:14:34.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hopefully po makapag-reinforce po natin yung budget ng DA patungkol po doon sa mga fertilizer assistance and all.

asr-007889
07:14:34.980 --> 07:14:38.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But we will do our best. I can give you my assurance po.

asr-007890
07:14:38.720 --> 07:14:47.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon po sa tanong patungkol po sa paggagawa ng line item para po sa iba't ibang components ng LGSF.

asr-007891
07:14:47.480 --> 07:14:59.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bagamat, ideally, gusto sana natin na ma-i-line item yun at ma-identify na po sa punto na ating pag-aproba ng HGAB.

asr-007892
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:08.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ano po kasi? Request-driven. Request-driven po kasi yung pag-evaluate at pag-release ng LGSF.

asr-007893
07:15:08.540 --> 07:15:16.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At sa kanilahilanan po na ito, at the point of us deliberating on the HGAB and the GAA,

asr-007894
07:15:16.480 --> 07:15:26.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we still do not have visibility as to which LGUs will be requesting for projects under LGSF in the upcoming fiscal year.

asr-007895
07:15:26.120 --> 07:15:32.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, parang ang sagot niyo po doon sa tanong ko ay no, ano, hindi po. Tama po ba?

asr-007896
07:15:33.920 --> 07:15:42.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, unfortunately, as much as it pains me to say, opo, hindi po kaya na-align item sa punto po ng HGAB.

asr-007897
07:15:42.760 --> 07:15:49.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, kung hindi po, ang tanong po ng marami ay, kung ganyan,

asr-007898
07:15:49.280 --> 07:15:55.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano na ang pinagkaiba ng LGSF sa pork barrel na tinatawag na unconstitutional

asr-007899
07:15:55.160 --> 07:15:58.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng Supreme Court sa Belgica v. Ochoa?

asr-007900
07:16:08.720 --> 07:16:17.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, if I may, so with regard to this point po, the Supreme Court has already addressed this legal question.

asr-007901
07:16:17.740 --> 07:16:23.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The Supreme Court, in the case of Belgica v. Secretary of Budget and Management et al.,

asr-007902
07:16:23.940 --> 07:16:25.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: has already ruled that,

asr-007903
07:16:25.160 --> 07:16:32.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: LGSF is a valid item of appropriation as it complies with the rule on singular correspondence

asr-007904
07:16:32.120 --> 07:16:40.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because it has the discernible and singular appropriation purpose of providing funds for the support of local government units.

asr-007905
07:16:40.240 --> 07:16:43.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It satisfies both the completeness and sufficient standard test.

asr-007906
07:16:44.820 --> 07:16:53.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That's why there has already been jurisprudence on the matter, which essentially says that LGSF is not pork barrel.

asr-007907
07:16:54.000 --> 07:16:55.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker,

asr-007908
07:16:55.180 --> 07:16:56.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-007909
07:16:56.440 --> 07:16:59.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sigurado po ako na unawaan niyo where our reservation is coming from,

asr-007910
07:17:00.100 --> 07:17:03.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: particularly po dito sa highly discretionary na nature ng pondo.

asr-007911
07:17:04.320 --> 07:17:12.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, kinakailangan talaga ng transparency when it comes to the criteria, the scorecard,

asr-007912
07:17:13.400 --> 07:17:15.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano ba talaga yung rules that govern this.

asr-007913
07:17:16.060 --> 07:17:21.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi if you understand it correctly, the Growth Equity Fund Circular does contain a real formula.

asr-007914
07:17:21.780 --> 07:17:24.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito pong larger assistance window does not.

asr-007915
07:17:24.020 --> 07:17:25.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: It turns on a scorecard.

asr-007916
07:17:25.160 --> 07:17:27.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: It turns on a scorecard that DBM wrote and has not yet published.

asr-007917
07:17:28.400 --> 07:17:36.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya nga po, through the Committee on Appropriations, baka pwede pong hingin natin yung scorecard, yung mga scores, yung ranking,

asr-007918
07:17:36.560 --> 07:17:42.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at ano po yung rule na kinakailangan para po constantly ma-check natin yung transparency when it comes to this.

asr-007919
07:17:42.800 --> 07:17:44.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-007920
07:17:51.340 --> 07:17:54.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, I have here in my possession,

asr-007921
07:17:54.940 --> 07:18:02.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: a copy of the scorecard which DBM uses to evaluate programs and projects.

asr-007922
07:18:02.540 --> 07:18:08.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we would be very happy po to share a copy of such scorecard to our distinguished colleague.

asr-007923
07:18:10.420 --> 07:18:18.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But if I may quickly po go through, very high level lang naman po yung categories dito po sa scorecard.

asr-007924
07:18:19.380 --> 07:18:22.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So there are several areas we're looking at.

asr-007925
07:18:22.240 --> 07:18:24.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's good financial housekeeping.

asr-007926
07:18:24.060 --> 07:18:29.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Functionality of the Local Development Council, Compliance with Subaybayan Reporting Requirements,

asr-007927
07:18:29.060 --> 07:18:33.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Financial Accomplishment, Physical Accomplishment, and Additional Criteria.

asr-007928
07:18:33.060 --> 07:18:37.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So yun po yung ilan sa mga pamantayan doon po sa scorecard.

asr-007929
07:18:37.060 --> 07:18:41.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat po Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-007930
07:18:41.060 --> 07:18:47.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo doon sa usapin ng abandoned at declaration of savings.

asr-007931
07:18:47.060 --> 07:18:53.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, what does abandoned mean for purposes of declaring savings?

asr-007932
07:18:53.060 --> 07:18:53.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can a project

asr-007933
07:18:53.540 --> 07:18:57.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: be declared abandoned even before the contract is awarded?

asr-007934
07:19:07.540 --> 07:19:20.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, it lies with the different agencies as to their criteria for determining what an abandoned project is.

asr-007935
07:19:20.540 --> 07:19:22.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: On the part po of the DBM, they're unable to answer.

asr-007936
07:19:23.540 --> 07:19:24.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At their level.

asr-007937
07:19:24.540 --> 07:19:35.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi po ang dumadating na lang po sa kanila ay ito na po yung listahan ng mga projects na deemed abandoned ng iba't ibang mga ahensya.

asr-007938
07:19:35.540 --> 07:19:41.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But we would be very happy po to facilitate, if I may commit on the part of DBM,

asr-007939
07:19:41.540 --> 07:19:50.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we can facilitate po the discussion with the different agencies as to what criteria they use po for the declaration of abandonment.

asr-007940
07:19:50.540 --> 07:19:55.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, hihintayin po natin yan from the DBM, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-007941
07:19:55.540 --> 07:19:58.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me now go to the last set of questions.

asr-007942
07:19:58.540 --> 07:20:00.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pasensya na po, I promise 15 minutes.

asr-007943
07:20:00.540 --> 07:20:02.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nag-exceed na po tayo ng 3 minutes.

asr-007944
07:20:02.540 --> 07:20:06.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Subukan po natin hanggang 20 minutes, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-007945
07:20:06.540 --> 07:20:12.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po ang aking huling tanong ay tungkol naman po sa program appropriations.

asr-007946
07:20:12.540 --> 07:20:18.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa 2026 GAA po, 97.3 billion ang nakalaan sa support to foreign assisted projects.

asr-007947
07:20:18.540 --> 07:20:30.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero nakapagtataka na as of August this year, 120.1 billion na ang nailabas.

asr-007948
07:20:30.540 --> 07:20:38.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So nagtataka po tayo, lagpas ito ng 22.8 billion sa budget na nilaan ng kongresong ito.

asr-007949
07:20:38.540 --> 07:20:44.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Again, 97 billion is in the GAA ang nailabas na thus far.

asr-007950
07:20:44.540 --> 07:20:47.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: August, 120.1 billion.

asr-007951
07:20:47.540 --> 07:20:55.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Anong authority po ang ginagamit para mapayaga nito at saan iyon po nakasaad sa ating GAA?

asr-007952
07:21:15.540 --> 07:21:16.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-007953
07:21:16.540 --> 07:21:17.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-007954
07:21:17.540 --> 07:21:26.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, looking at the report from DBM with regard to the status of fiscal year 2026 on program appropriations,

asr-007955
07:21:44.540 --> 07:21:46.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-007956
07:21:46.540 --> 07:21:51.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, looking at the line items pertained to by our distinguished colleague,

asr-007957
07:21:51.540 --> 07:22:02.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, we agree po on the point of the Honorable Cendaña that yung sa support to foreign assisted projects po,

asr-007958
07:22:02.540 --> 07:22:05.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: tumaas po doon sa nakaprogram na 97.

asr-007959
07:22:05.540 --> 07:22:08.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As of September po kasi itong tinitingnan ko.

asr-007960
07:22:08.540 --> 07:22:13.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mula po sa 97.3 billion, pataas po sa 129 billion.

asr-007961
07:22:13.540 --> 07:22:14.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Taba po iyon.

asr-007962
07:22:14.540 --> 07:22:15.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Taba po iyon.

asr-007963
07:22:15.540 --> 07:22:25.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The reason why nagkaroon po ng mas mataas na amount doon po sa releases is that within the unprogrammed appropriations,

asr-007964
07:22:25.540 --> 07:22:32.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: there's a special provision which allows for modification of purposes within unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-007965
07:22:32.540 --> 07:22:43.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, this is pursuant to special provision number 8 in the fiscal year 2026 unprogrammed appropriations section of the General Appropriations Act.

asr-007966
07:22:43.540 --> 07:22:45.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Saan po nang galing yun?

asr-007967
07:22:45.540 --> 07:22:46.540
