asr-007990
07:25:01.900 --> 07:25:26.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, upon conferring po with the DBM, as long as there is a court decision and second, the trigger for releases of unprogrammed appropriations is satisfied, which is there would be excess revenues po, definitely po magkukumplay po ang ating national government.

asr-007991
07:25:27.680 --> 07:25:31.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, medyo nababahala din po tayo sa sagot na ito ng DBM.

asr-007992
07:25:31.900 --> 07:25:34.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pagdating po sa pera na dapat po binalik natin sa PDIC.

asr-007993
07:25:35.760 --> 07:25:44.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But let me end with this, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, the people are demanding a closer look into the lump sum items under the GAA.

asr-007994
07:25:44.640 --> 07:25:51.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mandato ng Kongreso na magtakda ng malinaw na budget sa pamamagitan ng line-item program sa ating pong GAA.

asr-007995
07:25:51.400 --> 07:26:01.720
