asr-008157
07:39:10.060 --> 07:39:12.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: for very specific purposes.

asr-008158
07:39:13.100 --> 07:39:15.720
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: The earmarked excise taxes, therefore,

asr-008159
07:39:16.260 --> 07:39:18.780
