Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: I move to recognize

asr-008335
07:44:06.240 --> 07:44:08.840
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: Representative Sarah Jane Elago

asr-008336
07:44:08.840 --> 07:44:11.600
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: of Gabriela Women's Party List.

asr-008337
07:44:12.120 --> 07:44:13.800
