asr-008341
07:44:18.000 --> 07:44:19.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-008342
07:44:20.380 --> 07:44:22.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: This concern is about

asr-008343
07:44:22.160 --> 07:44:23.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: the Growth Equity Fund

asr-008344
07:44:23.740 --> 07:44:25.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: under the Local Government

asr-008345
07:44:25.300 --> 07:44:26.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Support Fund

asr-008346
07:44:26.160 --> 07:44:26.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: which,

asr-008347
07:44:26.760 --> 07:44:27.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: based on the

asr-008348
07:44:27.780 --> 07:44:28.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: description

asr-008349
07:44:28.400 --> 07:44:30.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: in the DILG site,

asr-008350
07:44:30.840 --> 07:44:31.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: is designed

asr-008351
07:44:31.420 --> 07:44:32.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: to address issues

asr-008352
07:44:32.900 --> 07:44:34.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: on marginalization

asr-008353
07:44:34.200 --> 07:44:35.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and equal development,

asr-008354
07:44:35.820 --> 07:44:36.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: high poverty incidence

asr-008355
07:44:36.980 --> 07:44:37.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and disparities

asr-008356
07:44:37.780 --> 07:44:39.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: in the net fiscal capacities

asr-008357
07:44:39.700 --> 07:44:40.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: of the LGUs

asr-008358
07:44:40.800 --> 07:44:43.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: under the Executive Order

asr-008359
07:44:43.100 --> 07:44:44.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: on Full Devolution.

asr-008360
07:44:45.020 --> 07:44:45.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now,

asr-008361
07:44:45.540 --> 07:44:47.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: from the year 2022,

asr-008362
07:44:48.220 --> 07:44:50.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: this particular item

asr-008363
07:44:50.640 --> 07:44:52.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: received thus far

asr-008364
07:44:52.060 --> 07:44:53.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for 2022,

asr-008365
07:44:53.340 --> 07:44:55.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 1.25 billion

asr-008366
07:44:55.240 --> 07:44:56.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for 2023,

asr-008367
07:44:56.920 --> 07:44:57.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 1 billion.

asr-008368
07:44:57.780 --> 07:44:58.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: No allocation

asr-008369
07:44:58.840 --> 07:44:59.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for 2024.

asr-008370
07:45:00.000 --> 07:45:08.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 700 million for 2025, for 2026, 11.3 billion, and for 2027, 10.3 billion.

asr-008371
07:45:09.240 --> 07:45:19.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know from the distinguished sponsor how many beneficiaries from the LGU have received funds from this GEF?

asr-008372
07:45:48.190 --> 07:45:56.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Or kahit yung total number na lang po ng LGU beneficiaries at hihingin na lang po natin yung breakdown kada taon.

asr-008372-split-2
07:45:56.740 --> 07:46:00.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker, my distinguished colleague.

asr-008373
07:46:00.600 --> 07:46:31.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, ang meron lang po kami ngayon is as far back as 2023. That one po I can say right now, but DBM po will get the data for 2022. For 2023 po, sorry, nabulag ako. For 2022 po pala meron. It is a total of, hindi lang naka-total, 150, 270, 430 LGUs po for the year 2022. For the year 2023, 170 LGUs.

asr-008374
07:46:31.400 --> 07:46:48.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2025, wala po sa 2024. Sa 2025 po, a total of 244. And for 2026 po, 875.

asr-008374-split-2
07:46:48.140 --> 07:47:00.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 875. Tama po ba? Dahil ito ay lump sum, hindi yan nakalista sa GAA for the years provided by the distinguished sponsor.

asr-008375
07:47:08.160 --> 07:47:31.930
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague. Opo. For the 2026 GAA, there is no annex wherein the list of beneficiaries is listed out, pero meron lang pong criteria na dapat po yung Growth Equity Fund ay para po sa fourth and fifth class municipalities.

asr-008376
07:47:32.880 --> 07:47:55.730
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, yung kawalan ng listahan dito sa GEF hindi lang po sa 2026, tama po ba? Simula po magsimula itong fund na ito, lahat nung mga proyekto ay post-GAA na po, post-enactment na na isasama o na-identify at nabibigyan ng pondo.

asr-008377
07:48:01.360 --> 07:48:44.990
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague. Yes po, kasi po meron pong, in theory po, every time we pass the GAA, there is already a qualified list of municipalities, cities and provinces po that qualify for the Growth Equity Fund, which is the master list essentially of all the LGUs that are considered as fourth and fifth class municipalities. But as to the amounts po, halimbawa kung magkano yung matatanggap ng bawat isa sa mga LGUs, tama po yun, wala po yun sa level ng GAA. That is determined po after the GAA is already passed.

asr-008378
07:48:45.660 --> 07:48:59.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, bakit po sa kabila ng pagkakaroon na ng master list, halimbawa nung target po natin na matulungan ng mga LGUs na mga fourth at fifth class municipalities, may listahan na ito. At hindi po ba nakadepende din ang tulong na ibibigay

asr-008379
07:48:59.980 --> 07:49:27.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng Growth Equity Fund sa devolution transition plan ng ating mga municipalities? Ibig sabihin meron na pong agarang batayan ang ating mga ahensya kung paano tiyak na maa-identify ang mga LGU, kung magkano at anong proyekto ang ilalagak sa ating GAA, pero bakit hindi po ba ito ginagawa? Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor. Sorry.

asr-008388
07:49:40.270 --> 07:49:45.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, upon conferring with DBM,

asr-008389
07:49:46.140 --> 07:49:53.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sa level po ng NEP, kapag sinumite po nila sa atin ng ehekutibo yung NEP,

asr-008390
07:49:53.440 --> 07:49:56.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: meron na po siyang kaakibat na listahan.

asr-008391
07:49:56.240 --> 07:50:00.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron sa kanila, hindi po ina-attach doon sa mismong NEP,

asr-008392
07:50:00.440 --> 07:50:07.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pero meron po silang listahan na siyang basihan po noong pong amount na kanila pong tinatalaga

asr-008393
07:50:07.140 --> 07:50:09.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa growth equity fund sa NEP.

asr-008394
07:50:09.820 --> 07:50:13.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: However, that's actually not an attachment to the NEP,

asr-008395
07:50:13.900 --> 07:50:22.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but it is possible, it is technically possible to have such a list attached to the NEP and later on the GAA.

asr-008396
07:50:22.300 --> 07:50:25.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

asr-008397
07:50:25.620 --> 07:50:28.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May nasa 10 bilyon na pondo para dito para sa susunod na taon.

asr-008398
07:50:29.000 --> 07:50:38.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, tulad ng nasabing nyo, meron ng handang listahan na may mga proyekto at amount ng pondo para sa mga LGUs na ito.

asr-008399
07:50:38.940 --> 07:50:39.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba?

asr-008400
07:50:55.620 --> 07:51:11.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ...

asr-008401
07:51:11.080 --> 07:51:13.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-008402
07:51:14.120 --> 07:51:22.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pinapakita po sa akin ng DBM ngayon na meron na pong sa bawat klase ng local government unit

asr-008403
07:51:22.700 --> 07:51:25.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na pupapasok po.

asr-008404
07:51:25.620 --> 07:51:32.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon sa klasifikasyon ng 4th and 5th class municipality, meron na pong determined level ng allocation.

asr-008405
07:51:33.080 --> 07:51:35.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Halimbawa po, magbibigay lang po ako ng example,

asr-008406
07:51:37.340 --> 07:51:45.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: isa lang po yung probinsya sa buong bansa sa labas ng BARM na considered po na 4th and 5th class or 5th class which is Batanes.

asr-008407
07:51:45.880 --> 07:51:50.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron na pong identified amount dito na 51.5 million pesos.

asr-008408
07:51:51.140 --> 07:51:55.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa cities po, halimbawa may siyam na fourth and fifth class cities.

asr-008409
07:51:55.620 --> 07:52:01.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron po silang total allocation of 463.5 million.

asr-008410
07:52:01.440 --> 07:52:07.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So meron pong designated amount per LGU.

asr-008411
07:52:07.680 --> 07:52:15.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero as for the projects that will be funded under the growth equity fund,

asr-008412
07:52:15.680 --> 07:52:19.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it still depends po on what the LGUs will request.

asr-008413
07:52:19.220 --> 07:52:23.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But there are guidelines that govern.

asr-008414
07:52:23.660 --> 07:52:25.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The types of projects.

asr-008415
07:52:25.620 --> 07:52:26.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That can be released to them.

asr-008416
07:52:27.040 --> 07:52:32.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron pong menu noong mga items na pwede po nilang i-request sa ilalim po ng growth equity fund.

asr-008417
07:52:33.240 --> 07:52:35.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

asr-008418
07:52:35.600 --> 07:52:40.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na daw clear identification noong mga LGUs na makakatanggap.

asr-008419
07:52:40.340 --> 07:52:50.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang sinasabi kaya nananatiling lump sum ay hindi pa identified kung ano yung kailangan ng barangay o municipality na mag-request.

asr-008420
07:52:51.100 --> 07:52:54.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi rin ang ating distinguished sponsor na meron namang guidelines.

asr-008421
07:52:54.540 --> 07:52:55.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit nababalik.

asr-008422
07:52:55.620 --> 07:53:03.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabahala po tayo dahil laging ang guidelines na nilalabas ay pagkatapos na ng enactment ng GAA.

asr-008423
07:53:03.040 --> 07:53:09.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan po ay nangyari ng 2022, 2023, 2025, 2026.

asr-008424
07:53:09.860 --> 07:53:24.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At maski po ngayong 2027, nakalagay po dito na ang release po ng funds ay magiging subject pa sa guidelines na i-issue po ng DBM in coordination sa DILG, DOF, DEPDev,

asr-008425
07:53:24.340 --> 07:53:26.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at iba pang mga relevant agencies.

asr-008426
07:53:27.960 --> 07:53:38.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba kapag ganito ang sistema Madam Speaker, mas lumalawak po yung espasyo ng maari itong prone sa misuse, abuse,

asr-008427
07:53:38.940 --> 07:53:47.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung lump sum na nga, discretionary pabatay dun sa ilalabas na menu na may guidelines na hanggang ngayon hindi pa rin natin nakikita.

asr-008428
07:53:49.100 --> 07:53:53.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, I agree po with the Honorable Elago.

asr-008429
07:53:53.340 --> 07:54:07.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, sa kasalukuyan po kasi yung special provision ngayon, ang nakalagay po, release of funds for the growth equity fund shall be subject to the guidelines to be issued by DBM in coordination with DILG, DOF, DEPDev, and other relevant agencies.

asr-008430
07:54:07.940 --> 07:54:10.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yun lang po yung kasalukuyan na nakalagay sa GAA.

asr-008431
07:54:11.740 --> 07:54:17.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero siguro po similar to my response po to the Honorable EG Erice,

asr-008433
07:54:18.300 --> 07:54:21.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we so wish po.

asr-008434
07:54:23.340 --> 07:54:29.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bukas naman po yung DBM na pwede po natin i-refine yung special provision further.

asr-008435
07:54:30.380 --> 07:54:37.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Bukas po sila na ilagay na po natin dito kung ano po yung mga panuntunan na gusto po natin na idagdag.

asr-008436
07:54:37.860 --> 07:54:47.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: O yung isa pa pong kanina, yung suhesyon po na talakay po natin kasama po si Honorable Erice,

asr-008437
07:54:47.320 --> 07:54:51.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay pwedeng kapag na-develop po ng guidelines patungkol dito,

asr-008438
07:54:51.780 --> 07:54:55.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kailangan pong kunin yung approval ng Kongreso.

asr-008439
07:54:55.780 --> 07:55:09.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, again, the DBM is open to any refinements to the special provision for us to, I guess, have more clear say on the part of Congress

asr-008440
07:55:09.480 --> 07:55:13.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kung ano po yung mga panuntunan na kailangan sundan para po sa growth equity fund.

asr-008441
07:55:14.460 --> 07:55:20.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, malinaw po, meron namang malinaw na pagbatayan para hindi maging lump sum ang growth equity fund.

asr-008442
07:55:20.540 --> 07:55:20.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayan.

asr-008443
07:55:20.820 --> 07:55:31.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya dapat itemized yan, dapat meron nang guidelines bago pa man maipasa itong GAA. Meron na dapat ngayong malinaw na pamantayan kung paano ito gagamitin.

asr-008444
07:55:31.120 --> 07:55:37.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At higit sa lahat po, kinakailangan natin mapanagot kung merong may abuso sa paggamit nito.

asr-008445
07:55:37.500 --> 07:55:43.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil kung hindi po natin yan gagawin, mananatilin pong isang malinaw na pork fund, ang growth equity fund.

asr-008446
07:55:43.860 --> 07:55:50.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung walang malinaw na pamantayan kung paano ito tiyak na mapupunta sa servisyo na kailangan.

asr-008447
07:55:50.820 --> 07:55:51.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng tao.

asr-008448
07:55:51.520 --> 07:55:54.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-008449
07:55:55.040 --> 07:56:01.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Manghihingi na lang po tayo ng ulat tungkol dun sa responsibility and accountability guidelines ng growth equity fund.

asr-008450
07:56:01.480 --> 07:56:02.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-008451
07:56:03.060 --> 07:56:06.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, we will comply po. We will share the same to the Honorable Elago.

asr-008452
07:56:07.040 --> 07:56:08.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po.

asr-008453
07:56:09.140 --> 07:56:09.700
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-008454
07:56:11.280 --> 07:56:20.160
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: Madam Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move to recognize Representative Attorney Renee Louise Co of Kabataan Partylist.

asr-008455
07:56:20.820 --> 07:56:24.900
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Renee Louise Co of Kabataan Partylist is hereby recognized for her interpellation.

asr-008456
07:56:26.560 --> 07:56:30.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magandang gabi po, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat po.

asr-008457
07:56:30.760 --> 07:56:33.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And magandang gabi rin po to the Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-008458
07:56:34.480 --> 07:56:46.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tatanong din po tayo ang mga natanong na rin po natin sa ibang mga ahensya but we still felt it appropriate to ask for the lump sum funds dahil po classified under LGSF

asr-008459
07:56:47.520 --> 07:56:50.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang support to the Barangay Development Program of the NTF-ELCAC.

asr-008460
07:56:50.820 --> 07:57:12.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa pagbaybay lang po ng kasaysayan ng Barangay Development Program of the NTF-ELCAC, nagsimula po ito ng GAA 2021 at nagpapatuloy nitong 2027 at tinignan po natin yung mga allotments na kada taon nag-iiba.

asr-008461
07:57:13.080 --> 07:57:19.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pansin po natin na yung budget it also varies pero nag-vary din yung numbers ng mga barangay.

asr-008462
07:57:20.820 --> 07:57:28.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang recipient nito from 822 ng 2021 to ngayong GAA 2027, 1,948.

asr-008463
07:57:28.860 --> 07:57:41.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Wala pong isang taon na pare-pareho yung number ng mga barangays na purportedly cleared and therefore ay maaaring makakuha ng support sa BDP.

asr-008464
07:57:43.140 --> 07:57:48.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At iba-iba rin po yung allotments. 2021, 20 million each for the 822 barangays.

asr-008465
07:57:49.740 --> 07:57:50.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2022,

asr-008466
07:57:50.820 --> 07:57:54.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 4 million each for the 1,406 barangays.

asr-008467
07:57:55.000 --> 07:57:55.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2023,

asr-008468
07:57:56.320 --> 07:58:00.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 6.6 million each for 959 barangays.

asr-008469
07:58:01.160 --> 07:58:01.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2024,

asr-008470
07:58:01.900 --> 07:58:05.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million each for 864 barangays.

asr-008471
07:58:05.200 --> 07:58:05.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2025,

asr-008472
07:58:05.860 --> 07:58:08.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million each for 780 barangays.

asr-008473
07:58:09.580 --> 07:58:10.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2026,

asr-008474
07:58:10.500 --> 07:58:12.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 10 million each for 808 barangays.

asr-008475
07:58:13.020 --> 07:58:13.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And ngayon po,

asr-008476
07:58:13.680 --> 07:58:17.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 5 million each for 1,948 barangays.

asr-008477
07:58:17.640 --> 07:58:18.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker,

asr-008478
07:58:18.260 --> 07:58:19.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good Sponsor,

asr-008479
07:58:19.740 --> 07:58:20.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi pa rin po

asr-008480
07:58:20.800 --> 07:58:29.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nasasagot sa amin yung tanong na what constitutes cleared barangays under the Barangay Development Program.

asr-008481
07:58:29.940 --> 07:58:45.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po sa ating binigay na essentially paraan paano ikaklassify at gagawin po ng DILG at ico-collate ng DBM yung ganitong listahan in a year.

asr-008482
07:58:45.780 --> 07:58:49.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But we'd like to pursue that line of question, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-008483
07:58:49.600 --> 07:58:49.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-008484
07:58:50.800 --> 07:58:59.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Natatrack po ba ng DBM sa budget books kung aling mga barangay ang naging beneficiary ng BDP sa mga nagdaang taon?

asr-008485
07:59:00.020 --> 07:59:15.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Natatrack po ba niya, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, if one barangay has been cleared for all years, may ilang barangay ba na hindi maki-clear in a particular year, mawawala sa listahan, may bago, etc.?

asr-008486
07:59:15.600 --> 07:59:19.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, ano po bang tracking na ginawa ng DBM dito?

asr-008487
07:59:20.800 --> 07:59:32.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yung determination po patungkol sa ano yung cleared barangay, nagmumula po yan sa NTF-ELCAC.

asr-008488
07:59:33.080 --> 07:59:38.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ang binibigay lang po sa DBM ay yung listahan na po ng mga cleared barangays.

asr-008489
07:59:39.640 --> 07:59:48.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung patungkol po dun sa beneficiary barangays, every year po, as you mentioned, for example, 2021, 822 barangays.

asr-008490
07:59:48.640 --> 07:59:50.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2022, 1,000.

asr-008491
07:59:50.800 --> 07:59:54.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 406 barangays, and so on and so forth po, until 2026.

asr-008492
07:59:57.160 --> 07:59:59.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Isang beses lang po, pwedeng makatanggap.

asr-008493
08:00:00.000 --> 08:00:06.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng SBDP, yung LGSF SBDP, yung particular cleared barangay.

asr-008494
08:00:06.880 --> 08:00:08.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So they can only receive once po.

asr-008495
08:00:09.220 --> 08:00:14.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Even though they're declared earlier as a cleared barangay or later,

asr-008496
08:00:15.920 --> 08:00:21.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nakadepende po sa kailan po isusumite ng NTF-ELCAC sa DBM

asr-008497
08:00:21.800 --> 08:00:27.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po as a qualified barangay po for LGSF SBDP.

asr-008498
08:00:27.160 --> 08:00:33.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, is the sponsor confirming that this is a one-time grant?

asr-008499
08:00:34.320 --> 08:00:40.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meaning kung nabigay na po ito ng isang taon, ay hindi na po ito mabibigay sa mga succeeding years?

asr-008500
08:00:41.040 --> 08:00:42.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-008501
08:00:42.560 --> 08:00:44.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes po, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-008502
08:00:45.020 --> 08:00:47.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: DBM confirms po that this is a one-time grant.

asr-008503
08:00:47.780 --> 08:00:52.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Once you've received it, you can no longer receive it in succeeding years.

asr-008504
08:00:53.060 --> 08:00:57.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, hindi po ba unfair sa barangay?

asr-008505
08:00:57.160 --> 08:01:02.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung barangays who've declared themselves cleared earlier, 20 million each ang nakuha.

asr-008506
08:01:03.020 --> 08:01:09.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo for example, in 2021, kumpara po sa mga ibang taon, for example, 2024, 2025,

asr-008507
08:01:09.660 --> 08:01:12.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.5 million pesos lang kada barangay yung nakuha.

asr-008508
08:01:16.700 --> 08:01:20.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yes, we agree with the point.

asr-008509
08:01:20.480 --> 08:01:23.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The DBM agrees with the point of our Distinguished Colleague.

asr-008510
08:01:24.300 --> 08:01:26.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung determination po kasi as to how much,

asr-008511
08:01:26.840 --> 08:01:30.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: how much each barangay would receive in a particular year

asr-008512
08:01:30.380 --> 08:01:36.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is dependent on the allocation that LGSF SBDP receives for a particular year.

asr-008513
08:01:36.740 --> 08:01:44.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because for a particular year, the number of beneficiary barangays is predetermined by NTF-ELCAC.

asr-008514
08:01:44.960 --> 08:01:52.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, halimbawa po, nagkataon na ang liit ng alokasyon ng SBDP sa taon na yun,

asr-008515
08:01:52.340 --> 08:01:56.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yun po, I agree po, nagkakataon po na,

asr-008516
08:01:56.840 --> 08:01:58.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: mababa talaga yung natatanggap nila.

asr-008517
08:01:58.240 --> 08:02:04.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May pagkakataon din naman po na konti lang sila na cleared barangays na nag-qualify,

asr-008518
08:02:04.800 --> 08:02:07.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: tas malaki yung alokasyon, so mas malaki po yung natatanggap nila.

asr-008519
08:02:07.740 --> 08:02:12.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, the DBM recognizes po the point of our Distinguished Colleague na

asr-008520
08:02:12.680 --> 08:02:17.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because of the formula and the determination,

asr-008521
08:02:18.680 --> 08:02:22.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: nagkakataon nga po talaga that some years are higher than others.

asr-008522
08:02:22.800 --> 08:02:24.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-008523
08:02:24.960 --> 08:02:26.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: since na-mention na one time,

asr-008524
08:02:26.840 --> 08:02:35.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: masasabi po ba ng DBM with definitiveness na wala pong isang barangay na duplicate

asr-008525
08:02:35.220 --> 08:02:43.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nakakuha ng multiple times para po sa barangay development program?

asr-008526
08:03:05.810 --> 08:03:07.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-008527
08:03:07.780 --> 08:03:11.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kami po ni Sec Kim dito sa likod, tinatanong po namin yung team,

asr-008528
08:03:11.380 --> 08:03:17.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are you absolutely sure that there's no barangay that received the SBDP twice?

asr-008529
08:03:18.500 --> 08:03:24.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And they confirm po, as far as they know po, there's no barangay po that has received it twice.

asr-008530
08:03:24.820 --> 08:03:26.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's also data in Compass po,

asr-008531
08:03:26.840 --> 08:03:31.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the DBM website that we can use to verify that information.

asr-008532
08:03:31.660 --> 08:03:38.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Does DBM check that po yearly na kung anumang listahang binibigay ng DILG

asr-008533
08:03:38.280 --> 08:03:44.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or ang iba't ibang ahensya ay hindi po nakakuha na noon pa?

asr-008534
08:04:11.340 --> 08:04:12.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-008535
08:04:12.660 --> 08:04:16.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: sorry, we're just probing also, making sure that the answer is correct.

asr-008536
08:04:35.010 --> 08:04:36.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-008537
08:04:38.560 --> 08:04:44.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the DBM relies greatly on the list,

asr-008538
08:04:44.900 --> 08:04:51.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the recommended barangays that is included in the list submitted by the NTF-ELCAC,

asr-008539
08:04:51.580 --> 08:04:56.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but the DBM agrees that they should do a second check,

asr-008540
08:04:56.840 --> 08:05:00.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: just to make sure that there are no duplicate barangays po.

asr-008541
08:05:02.060 --> 08:05:06.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang separate check na po ba ito, gagawin po ba ngayon,

asr-008542
08:05:06.340 --> 08:05:10.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or pwede po bang magsumite na lang po ang report ng DBM?

asr-008543
08:05:19.000 --> 08:05:23.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker, so they rely on the attestation,

asr-008544
08:05:23.220 --> 08:05:26.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: so there's a certification that NTF-ELCAC,

asr-008545
08:05:26.840 --> 08:05:31.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: specifically issues to certify that there are no duplicate barangays,

asr-008546
08:05:31.540 --> 08:05:35.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: but the DBM commits po that from here on out, moving forward,

asr-008547
08:05:35.980 --> 08:05:38.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: they will do a second check po for duplicates.

asr-008548
08:05:39.480 --> 08:05:42.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, ito rin po yung line of questioning natin,

asr-008549
08:05:42.880 --> 08:05:45.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I think, noong nagtanong tayo sa general principles,

asr-008550
08:05:46.260 --> 08:05:48.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: aside from barangay development program,

asr-008551
08:05:48.180 --> 08:05:53.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kahit po yung challenge natin sa DBM for confidential and intelligence funds,

asr-008552
08:05:54.060 --> 08:05:56.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano po ba ine-exercise ng DBM?

asr-008553
08:05:56.840 --> 08:06:03.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung mandato nila na hindi lang sana collator ng mga budget requests

asr-008554
08:06:03.460 --> 08:06:07.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and i-compile for a NEP,

asr-008555
08:06:08.240 --> 08:06:12.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero ano po bang paraan na ginagawa nila to ensure na

asr-008556
08:06:12.460 --> 08:06:17.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga binubukas ng mga ibat-ibang ahensya at that level pa lang

asr-008557
08:06:17.560 --> 08:06:25.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: before po isubmit yung request for the budget at maaprubahan

asr-008558
08:06:25.060 --> 08:06:26.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at ma-spot maybe ng COA,

asr-008559
08:06:26.820 --> 08:06:30.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, two years down the line, kung mayroon pong pagkakamali,

asr-008560
08:06:30.780 --> 08:06:33.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may opportunity ang DBM kung paano po siya,

asr-008561
08:06:33.580 --> 08:06:39.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang i-double check, pero tignan kung mayroon pong kailangan i-improve or hindi.

asr-008562
08:06:39.760 --> 08:06:41.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nonetheless, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-008563
08:06:42.900 --> 08:06:48.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung mayroon pong maiprovide yung DBM na kopya ng attestation

asr-008564
08:06:48.460 --> 08:06:52.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para makita po natin kung ano pong mga checks yung ginagawa

asr-008565
08:06:52.120 --> 08:06:55.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng hindi lang ng DBM pero ng NTF-ELCAC and DILG,

asr-008566
08:06:56.820 --> 08:07:04.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para makita kung ano yung mga proseso nila sa paglatag,

asr-008567
08:07:04.400 --> 08:07:06.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: anong mga baranggay, yung cleared or hindi.

asr-008568
08:07:06.340 --> 08:07:09.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero dahil Madam Speaker, as I mentioned nga po earlier,

asr-008569
08:07:09.220 --> 08:07:11.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung isang point na po na, well, one, unfair.

asr-008570
08:07:12.800 --> 08:07:19.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: How can we say na each baranggay makukuha nila yung kailangan nila

asr-008571
08:07:19.240 --> 08:07:25.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: o yung dapat na makuha nila kung each year mukhang dependent sa allocation?

asr-008572
08:07:26.820 --> 08:07:27.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung makukuha o hindi.

asr-008573
08:07:28.200 --> 08:07:31.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 20 million for this year, 2.5 million the next.

asr-008574
08:07:32.860 --> 08:07:36.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: What's to say na ito talaga yung parang solusyon na kailangan nila?

asr-008575
08:07:37.400 --> 08:07:41.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And dahil, secondly, Madam Speaker, and this is our standing critique of the program,

asr-008576
08:07:42.020 --> 08:07:47.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nasa budget naman po ng mga iba't-ibang ahensya na may specific mandate

asr-008577
08:07:47.460 --> 08:07:54.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to provide these services na pwedeng dun po ilagay yung pangailangan

asr-008578
08:07:54.520 --> 08:07:56.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga local government units natin.

asr-008579
08:07:56.820 --> 08:08:01.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Rather than through this program na standing pa rin,

asr-008580
08:08:01.800 --> 08:08:05.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung pinupoint out natin na quote-unquote conditional development po

asr-008581
08:08:05.820 --> 08:08:10.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang inooffer ng barangay development program ng NTF-ELCAC.

asr-008582
08:08:10.220 --> 08:08:18.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And third point, kung this conditional development comes at the cost of the suppression of rights

asr-008583
08:08:18.860 --> 08:08:22.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and freedoms of the people, dahil ang report sa atin on ground,

asr-008584
08:08:22.780 --> 08:08:26.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano ba nag-clear yung isang baranggay, tatanong-tanongin,

asr-008586
08:08:26.800 --> 08:08:33.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ang student leader sa isang campus ay affiliated ka daw ba sa leftist groups?

asr-008587
08:08:33.400 --> 08:08:36.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can you sign this memo to say hindi? Etc.

asr-008588
08:08:37.480 --> 08:08:43.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Surveillance, harassment, lahat po ito ay begging the question na

asr-008589
08:08:43.740 --> 08:08:46.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is this the best way for development?

asr-008590
08:08:47.680 --> 08:08:52.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or is it, you know, proper funding of the different projects

asr-008591
08:08:52.700 --> 08:08:56.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the appropriate line items to the different agencies?

asr-008592
08:08:56.800 --> 08:09:01.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, hindi po ito ang tunay na pagpapaunlad.

asr-008593
08:09:01.540 --> 08:09:06.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi nito natutugunan ang sinasabi ng layunin na wakasan ng armadong tunggalian

asr-008594
08:09:06.320 --> 08:09:08.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nangyayari sa bansa natin ngayon.

asr-008595
08:09:08.180 --> 08:09:14.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa halip na ilagay ang programang malabo ang proseso at pamantayang para magpa-clear

asr-008596
08:09:14.280 --> 08:09:19.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at meron nga pong maaaring mangyari na may tunggalian pa sa mga baranggay

asr-008597
08:09:19.200 --> 08:09:21.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil hindi po pantay yung nakukuha nila,

asr-008598
08:09:21.640 --> 08:09:25.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mas mabuti pang ilagay na lang ang pondo sa direktang mga serbisyong panlipunan.

asr-008599
08:09:25.880 --> 08:09:26.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's all, Madam Speaker.

asr-008600
08:09:26.800 --> 08:09:30.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor, we look forward to receiving the report

asr-008601
08:09:30.860 --> 08:09:41.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on how DILG and NTF-ELCAC attests na hindi po duplicates and whatever else methods

asr-008602
08:09:41.960 --> 08:09:46.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to ensure na hindi naman nauulit yung mga baranggay

asr-008603
08:09:46.800 --> 08:09:50.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: as per the rules and regulations of this program.

asr-008604
08:09:51.060 --> 08:09:53.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But for now, I have no further questions.

asr-008605
08:09:54.360 --> 08:09:55.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much to the sponsor

asr-008606
08:09:56.800 --> 08:10:00.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for answering our questions and I yield my time to the floor.

asr-008607
08:10:00.920 --> 08:10:01.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker.

asr-008608
08:10:01.900 --> 08:10:03.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

asr-008609
08:10:03.520 --> 08:10:05.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much to the Honorable Renee Co.

asr-008610
08:10:06.160 --> 08:10:06.700
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-008611
08:10:07.520 --> 08:10:09.800
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: Madam Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor,

asr-008612
08:10:09.980 --> 08:10:15.120
Rep. Beverley Rose A. Dimacuha: I move to recognize Representative Antonio L. Tinio of ACT Teachers Partylist.

asr-008613
08:10:15.320 --> 08:10:19.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Antonio Tinio of ACT Teachers Partylist is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-008614
08:10:20.860 --> 08:10:22.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-008615
08:10:23.380 --> 08:10:24.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa sponsor,

asr-008616
08:10:24.260 --> 08:10:30.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bibilisan na lang po natin ang interpellation.

asr-008617
08:10:31.420 --> 08:10:32.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Less than 30 minutes na po.

asr-008618
08:10:33.980 --> 08:10:34.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba?

asr-008619
08:10:35.060 --> 08:10:35.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po.

asr-008620
08:10:36.240 --> 08:10:42.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, unang topic po natin ay yung pa ring Local Government Support Fund

asr-008621
08:10:42.380 --> 08:10:44.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil nasa lump sum funds po tayo.

asr-008622
08:10:45.000 --> 08:10:46.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron po tayong presentation.

asr-008623
08:10:47.700 --> 08:10:49.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Again, yan.

asr-008624
08:10:50.100 --> 08:10:50.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008625
08:10:50.380 --> 08:10:54.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nakikita po natin, again, one decade plus the proposal.

asr-008626
08:10:54.260 --> 08:10:55.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For 2027.

asr-008627
08:10:56.580 --> 08:11:00.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hindi ito unang pagkakataon na tumaas ang LGSF.

asr-008628
08:11:00.660 --> 08:11:02.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, you can see in 2018,

asr-008629
08:11:03.260 --> 08:11:06.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay 51 billion ang inabot nito.

asr-008630
08:11:09.020 --> 08:11:13.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As proposed, pero actually, ang appropriated, the orange one,

asr-008631
08:11:14.060 --> 08:11:16.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the highest was in 2021.

asr-008632
08:11:17.160 --> 08:11:19.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry, 2017 pala.

asr-008633
08:11:20.280 --> 08:11:20.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2017.

asr-008634
08:11:20.880 --> 08:11:21.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2017.

asr-008635
08:11:21.300 --> 08:11:22.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unang budget ni...

asr-008636
08:11:24.260 --> 08:11:26.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pangulong Duterte, nung panahon niya.

asr-008637
08:11:26.860 --> 08:11:29.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang pinakamataas nun ay 39 billion.

asr-008638
08:11:30.140 --> 08:11:30.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008639
08:11:30.460 --> 08:11:31.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Actual appropriations.

asr-008640
08:11:33.140 --> 08:11:38.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero talaga, bakit ba naging mainit na topic ang LGF?

asr-008641
08:11:38.680 --> 08:11:45.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil sa pagbukol nito, especially in the 2026 GAA.

asr-008642
08:11:45.700 --> 08:11:46.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung kasalukuyang taon.

asr-008643
08:11:47.680 --> 08:11:47.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008644
08:11:47.820 --> 08:11:52.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nakita natin, noong 2025, yung appropriated, yung orange,

asr-008645
08:11:54.260 --> 08:11:58.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 22.99 billion ang LGSF.

asr-008646
08:11:58.720 --> 08:12:03.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sa 2026 budget, naging 57.8 billion.

asr-008647
08:12:04.500 --> 08:12:04.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008648
08:12:05.080 --> 08:12:08.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, almost times 3 ang inilaki.

asr-008649
08:12:09.860 --> 08:12:10.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008650
08:12:10.120 --> 08:12:12.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po, controversial ngayon.

asr-008651
08:12:12.240 --> 08:12:14.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Even at the time, Madam Speaker,

asr-008652
08:12:15.720 --> 08:12:17.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: anong ginawa ito sa BICAM?

asr-008653
08:12:17.720 --> 08:12:18.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: BICAM po nangyari ito.

asr-008654
08:12:19.800 --> 08:12:19.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008655
08:12:19.940 --> 08:12:22.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sinabi na po ng kinatawang ito,

asr-008656
08:12:22.620 --> 08:12:27.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: presidential LGU pork yan.

asr-008657
08:12:27.480 --> 08:12:28.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun ang tinawag natin dyan.

asr-008658
08:12:28.820 --> 08:12:30.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: LGU pork ng presidente.

asr-008659
08:12:31.540 --> 08:12:31.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-008660
08:12:32.120 --> 08:12:36.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At, mamaya, ipapoint out din natin,

asr-008661
08:12:37.100 --> 08:12:40.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: saan ang galing yung pondo na nilagay dyan.

asr-008662
08:12:40.740 --> 08:12:41.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero yun ang point.

asr-008663
08:12:41.740 --> 08:12:45.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinapakita lang natin kung bakit mainit na topic ngayon ang LGSF.

asr-008664
08:12:45.940 --> 08:12:46.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide na po.

asr-008665
08:12:50.000 --> 08:12:51.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pinapakita lang yung mga components

asr-008666
08:12:51.800 --> 08:12:53.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nung LGSF.

asr-008667
08:12:54.700 --> 08:12:55.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Iba-iba nga.

asr-008668
08:12:55.940 --> 08:12:57.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nabanggit kanina, Growth Equity Fund.

asr-008669
08:12:58.540 --> 08:13:00.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kanina lang, tinatanong yung tungkol sa

asr-008670
08:13:00.660 --> 08:13:03.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Barangay Development Program.

asr-008671
08:13:05.080 --> 08:13:07.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ang pinakamalaking component yan,

asr-008672
08:13:07.800 --> 08:13:08.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: single biggest component,

asr-008673
08:13:09.120 --> 08:13:11.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: is yung tinatawag na financial assistance

asr-008674
08:13:11.120 --> 08:13:12.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to local government units.

asr-008675
08:13:13.060 --> 08:13:14.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yun yung talagang lumaki.

asr-008676
08:13:14.780 --> 08:13:18.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it's 37.49 billion.

asr-008677
08:13:19.040 --> 08:13:19.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008678
08:13:20.240 --> 08:13:21.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide.

asr-008679
08:13:21.800 --> 08:13:24.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito lang.

asr-008680
08:13:24.340 --> 08:13:27.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinapakita lang kung gaano yung naging paglaki

asr-008681
08:13:27.160 --> 08:13:29.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng financial assistance to local government units.

asr-008682
08:13:30.520 --> 08:13:31.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, as I said,

asr-008683
08:13:32.000 --> 08:13:35.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bumukol talaga nung,

asr-008684
08:13:36.760 --> 08:13:37.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: well, lumaki na.

asr-008685
08:13:37.840 --> 08:13:38.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Actually, papalaki na

asr-008686
08:13:38.700 --> 08:13:42.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: during the Marcos Junior Administration.

asr-008687
08:13:43.340 --> 08:13:44.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As you can see,

asr-008688
08:13:44.940 --> 08:13:46.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may pataas na trajectory.

asr-008689
08:13:47.300 --> 08:13:51.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2025, it was already at 18.9 billion.

asr-008690
08:13:51.800 --> 08:13:54.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But 2026, talagang

asr-008691
08:13:54.520 --> 08:14:00.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nag-skyrocket to 37.4 billion.

asr-008692
08:14:00.380 --> 08:14:01.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And also note,

asr-008693
08:14:01.960 --> 08:14:04.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na lumalaki yung orange bar.

asr-008694
08:14:04.340 --> 08:14:05.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin nun,

asr-008695
08:14:05.160 --> 08:14:06.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kongreso ang nagdadagdag.

asr-008696
08:14:06.820 --> 08:14:07.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi yan NEP.

asr-008697
08:14:08.240 --> 08:14:10.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, congressional intervention,

asr-008698
08:14:10.760 --> 08:14:12.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: insertion, whatever you may call it.

asr-008699
08:14:14.000 --> 08:14:14.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008700
08:14:15.540 --> 08:14:15.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now,

asr-008701
08:14:16.560 --> 08:14:19.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kanina, pinakita po ng kasamahan natin

asr-008702
08:14:19.080 --> 08:14:21.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung regional allocation.

asr-008703
08:14:21.160 --> 08:14:21.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

asr-008704
08:14:22.080 --> 08:14:24.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung regional and then hanggang mga city level.

asr-008705
08:14:24.940 --> 08:14:26.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, hinighlight nga.

asr-008706
08:14:26.920 --> 08:14:27.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit ganon?

asr-008707
08:14:27.600 --> 08:14:28.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ba ang kriteriya?

asr-008708
08:14:28.980 --> 08:14:30.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino nag-de-decide?

asr-008709
08:14:30.740 --> 08:14:32.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At bakit tila mas malaki

asr-008710
08:14:32.200 --> 08:14:33.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga mas mayamang syudad?

asr-008711
08:14:34.020 --> 08:14:35.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mas malaki pa ang nakukuha?

asr-008712
08:14:35.700 --> 08:14:37.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ito naman, additional lang.

asr-008713
08:14:38.360 --> 08:14:41.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ito, mas sa level ng individual projects.

asr-008714
08:14:41.400 --> 08:14:43.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para ipakita lang natin sa napunta

asr-008715
08:14:43.140 --> 08:14:47.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga, yung financial assistance.

asr-008716
08:14:48.120 --> 08:14:50.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, these are the top five

asr-008717
08:14:50.220 --> 08:14:51.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: biggest projects.

asr-008718
08:14:51.160 --> 08:14:53.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Biggest single projects.

asr-008719
08:14:54.780 --> 08:14:57.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Particularly, yung capital outlay projects

asr-008720
08:14:57.380 --> 08:14:59.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na pinunduhan ng financial assistance.

asr-008721
08:15:00.000 --> 08:15:00.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung FALGU.

asr-008722
08:15:01.380 --> 08:15:01.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

asr-008723
08:15:02.000 --> 08:15:05.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noong 2025, single biggest project, 500 million.

asr-008724
08:15:06.380 --> 08:15:10.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para nga yan sa multi-purpose building sa pamantasan ng lungsod ng Maynila.

asr-008725
08:15:10.640 --> 08:15:11.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 500 million.

asr-008726
08:15:12.600 --> 08:15:18.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Second biggest, yung 450 million na ito nasa balita na talaga.

asr-008727
08:15:18.360 --> 08:15:24.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung para sa retrofitting and rehab ng Robredo Coliseum sa Naga City.

asr-008728
08:15:25.740 --> 08:15:27.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Third, Guimaras Province.

asr-008729
08:15:27.780 --> 08:15:33.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 200 million peso multi-purpose building, phase two.

asr-008730
08:15:34.500 --> 08:15:39.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Fourth, nakita naman natin dyan, a farm-to-market road, 150 million.

asr-008731
08:15:39.660 --> 08:15:41.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malaking farm-to-market road ito.

asr-008732
08:15:41.900 --> 08:15:45.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi usually, ang farm-to-market road, 10, 15 million lang.

asr-008733
08:15:45.840 --> 08:15:52.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, Caloocan City, that's the fifth multi-purpose building para sa PNPBFP.

asr-008734
08:15:53.780 --> 08:15:54.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 135 million.

asr-008735
08:15:54.700 --> 08:15:55.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That's 2025.

asr-008736
08:15:56.160 --> 08:15:57.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2026.

asr-008737
08:15:57.780 --> 08:16:04.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para magka-idea din lang tayo, ang pinakamalaking infra-project, single, Batangas.

asr-008738
08:16:05.100 --> 08:16:06.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Partikular sa Lipa.

asr-008739
08:16:06.840 --> 08:16:11.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Multi-purpose building, phase one, 500 million pesos, single project.

asr-008740
08:16:12.320 --> 08:16:15.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, tapos San Juan City, may dalawang San Juan City.

asr-008741
08:16:15.000 --> 08:16:22.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: San Juan City, medical or hospital equipment, 356 million pesos.

asr-008742
08:16:22.840 --> 08:16:27.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Quezon City, rehab of a road, 179 million.

asr-008743
08:16:27.780 --> 08:16:37.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Laguna Province, purchase of 40 units ambulance, 143 million pesos.

asr-008744
08:16:38.080 --> 08:16:38.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wow!

asr-008745
08:16:39.460 --> 08:16:41.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napawaw din yung isang kasama natin dito.

asr-008746
08:16:42.480 --> 08:16:45.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil alam ko, lahat ng LGU.

asr-008747
08:16:46.140 --> 08:16:46.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

asr-008748
08:16:46.960 --> 08:16:47.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan ang gusto.

asr-008749
08:16:48.300 --> 08:16:51.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then San Juan City, hospital buildings, 100 million.

asr-008750
08:16:51.500 --> 08:16:55.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, just to give an idea kung ano yung posible at binibigay.

asr-008751
08:16:57.000 --> 08:16:57.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Through

asr-008752
08:16:57.780 --> 08:17:02.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung LGSF, particularly yung financial assistance.

asr-008753
08:17:02.560 --> 08:17:08.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang mga tanong nga, siguro kahit nung mga kinatawan dito, buti sila.

asr-008754
08:17:09.000 --> 08:17:09.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano naman yung iba?

asr-008755
08:17:10.160 --> 08:17:10.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano naman kami?

asr-008756
08:17:11.200 --> 08:17:12.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Who decides?

asr-008757
08:17:12.960 --> 08:17:16.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun nga ang tanong.

asr-008758
08:17:16.320 --> 08:17:17.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede po bang maipaliwanag?

asr-008759
08:17:18.960 --> 08:17:25.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino ang nagdi-decide kung sino ang mabibigyan, maaprubahan?

asr-008760
08:17:25.620 --> 08:17:27.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ano yung criteria?

asr-008761
08:17:27.780 --> 08:17:34.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Lalo pa dito sa mga infrastructure projects, parang wala yatang limit ito.

asr-008762
08:17:35.760 --> 08:17:48.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi yung financial assistance, typically, for infrastructure, it's 5 million, 10 million, pero tila umaabot hanggang 500 million.

asr-008763
08:17:49.200 --> 08:17:51.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, anong klaseng guidelines po ang nag-aalaw nito?

asr-008764
08:17:51.980 --> 08:17:57.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, could the sponsor enlighten us on how the FALGU works?

asr-008765
08:17:57.780 --> 08:17:58.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Who approves?

asr-008766
08:17:59.720 --> 08:18:00.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At bakit?

asr-008767
08:18:00.860 --> 08:18:01.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ganon.

asr-008768
08:18:02.500 --> 08:18:26.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, so the DBM, what we state in the GAA is that the DBM will be the one to execute from the point of evaluating to the point of releasing of the LGSF based on the menu po na ating inilalagay doon po sa GAA.

asr-008769
08:18:26.120 --> 08:18:26.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-008770
08:18:27.780 --> 08:18:33.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, in regard to how they evaluate, they have a scorecard po that they use as a basis.

asr-008771
08:18:34.400 --> 08:18:36.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That is their evaluation criteria.

asr-008772
08:18:36.960 --> 08:18:53.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tulad po ng nabanggit, ilan po sa mga tinitignan nila ay good financial housekeeping, functionality of the local development council, compliance with subay-bayan reporting requirements, financial accomplishment, physical accomplishment, and the like.

asr-008773
08:18:53.920 --> 08:18:57.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nakabase din po sila doon po sa request ng mga LGUs.

asr-008774
08:18:57.780 --> 08:19:01.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, yung iba po kasi LGU nag-request, yung iba naman po hindi din.

asr-008775
08:19:01.800 --> 08:19:06.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, limited din po sila by the types of requests na dumadating sa kanila.

asr-008776
08:19:06.780 --> 08:19:27.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, all of the whole process po from the time of setting the criteria and getting the requests po through the portal of DBM, evaluating it and eventually releasing it, lahat po yan nasa loob po ng DBM.

asr-008777
08:19:27.780 --> 08:19:29.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, una, emphasize ko lang.

asr-008778
08:19:29.780 --> 08:19:34.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po namin tinawag to, last year pa, this is presidential pork.

asr-008779
08:19:34.620 --> 08:19:36.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi sabi natin, discretionary ultimately.

asr-008780
08:19:37.420 --> 08:19:48.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malaking lump sum, tapos ultimately, it's up to the executive, president, to decide kung sino ang magagawaran at magkano.

asr-008781
08:19:49.340 --> 08:19:49.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Parang ganon.

asr-008782
08:19:51.860 --> 08:19:56.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, ang nililinaw po rito, actually, ang patakaran.

asr-008783
08:19:57.780 --> 08:20:07.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay DBM ang gumawa ng guidelines, DBM ang nag-evaluate ng mga applications or submissions, at DBM din ang nag-a-approve.

asr-008784
08:20:09.140 --> 08:20:12.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Including kung magkano yung ibibigay. Tama po ba?

asr-008785
08:20:12.720 --> 08:20:13.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po, Madam Speaker.

asr-008786
08:20:14.060 --> 08:20:21.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At tama rin po ba na under the guidelines of DBM, walang limit or cap, particularly doon sa capital outlay projects.

asr-008787
08:20:21.980 --> 08:20:26.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya po nakakakita tayo ng 500 million na isang proyekto lang.

asr-008788
08:20:27.100 --> 08:20:27.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-008789
08:20:27.780 --> 08:20:29.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, wala pong cap.

asr-008790
08:20:29.300 --> 08:20:33.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala rin cap. So, theoretically, pwede. Kahit 1 billion, pwede.

asr-008791
08:20:33.920 --> 08:20:34.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ganun nga.

asr-008792
08:20:35.320 --> 08:20:39.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, hindi po ba, wala po tayong nakikitang concern doon.

asr-008793
08:20:39.540 --> 08:20:49.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: From the point of view of kahit yung equity, katulad ng sinasabi kanina, napakaraming mga LGU na nangangailangan ng infrastructure.

asr-008794
08:20:49.980 --> 08:20:53.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano po tingin ng DBM? Guidelines nila yan eh.

asr-008795
08:20:55.100 --> 08:20:57.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-008796
08:20:57.780 --> 08:21:03.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Upon conferring with the DBM, yes po, we agree with the point of our distinguished colleague.

asr-008797
08:21:03.380 --> 08:21:13.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: A cap is something that they can explore in the evaluation criteria in the guidelines that they will adopt for 2027.

asr-008798
08:21:14.300 --> 08:21:21.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pwede po yan. Kasi tama naman po yung punto ng ating distinguished colleague na you have a limited fiscal space.

asr-008799
08:21:21.620 --> 08:21:26.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's only a finite amount that's allocated for FALGU.

asr-008800
08:21:26.780 --> 08:21:27.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tapos, biglang.

asr-008801
08:21:27.780 --> 08:21:34.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May malaking-malaki na isang request na makakain yung malaking porsyento noong kabuuan po.

asr-008802
08:21:34.360 --> 08:21:41.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, the DBM agrees po that putting a cap is something that can be explored in the succeeding fiscal years po.

asr-008803
08:21:41.760 --> 08:21:45.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, well, next point.

asr-008804
08:21:47.040 --> 08:21:54.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang binabanggit po talaga ay ang tumatanggap ng request at nag-a-approve from the LGUs at nag-a-approve DBM daw.

asr-008805
08:21:54.820 --> 08:21:57.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang papel ng presidente?

asr-008806
08:22:16.860 --> 08:22:25.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, as to the receiving of the requests, evaluation, approval, and eventual release,

asr-008807
08:22:25.520 --> 08:22:28.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wala pong involvement ang Presidente.

asr-008809
08:22:28.300 --> 08:22:30.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Walang involvement ang presidente.

asr-008810
08:22:31.440 --> 08:22:43.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker, and to the sponsor, pinag-uusapan po natin ay Local Government Support Fund and under that, the financial assistance to local government units.

asr-008811
08:22:43.460 --> 08:22:43.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct.

asr-008812
08:22:44.360 --> 08:22:44.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-008813
08:22:45.340 --> 08:22:48.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At hindi po ba kasama ito sa lump sum funds?

asr-008814
08:22:48.380 --> 08:22:48.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-008815
08:22:49.720 --> 08:22:50.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These are lump sums.

asr-008816
08:22:51.440 --> 08:22:51.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

asr-008817
08:22:53.060 --> 08:22:53.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Lump sum appropriations.

asr-008818
08:22:54.540 --> 08:22:54.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

asr-008819
08:22:54.660 --> 08:22:55.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-008820
08:22:55.640 --> 08:22:57.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These are lump sum appropriations.

asr-008821
08:22:57.600 --> 08:22:57.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-008822
08:22:57.900 --> 08:23:06.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At tama po ba o mali na ang pagbabudgeting, ang batas sa pagbabudgeting, bukod sa General Appropriations Act,

asr-008823
08:23:06.880 --> 08:23:16.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang umiiral na batas sa pagbabudget ay Executive Order 292, otherwise known as the Administrative Code of the Philippines.

asr-008824
08:23:16.200 --> 08:23:16.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

asr-008825
08:23:16.600 --> 08:23:16.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ...

asr-008826
08:23:21.540 --> 08:23:27.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Umiiral ang the provisions

asr-008827
08:23:27.080 --> 08:23:31.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the Administrative Code apply to budgeting.

asr-008828
08:23:32.020 --> 08:23:32.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

asr-008829
08:23:32.800 --> 08:23:33.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Tama po.

asr-008830
08:23:33.360 --> 08:23:35.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: EO 292 po ang batay.

asr-008831
08:23:35.960 --> 08:23:36.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yeah.

asr-008832
08:23:36.660 --> 08:23:37.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Including lump sum funds.

asr-008833
08:23:38.140 --> 08:23:38.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Section.

asr-008834
08:23:39.360 --> 08:23:42.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Puntahan po natin ang Book 6, Chapter 5, Section 35.

asr-008835
08:23:43.820 --> 08:23:44.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

asr-008836
08:23:44.720 --> 08:23:46.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, dapat nag-a-apply ito.

asr-008837
08:23:46.100 --> 08:23:51.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang sabi po, Section 35, Special Budgets for Lump Sum Appropriations.

asr-008838
08:23:52.140 --> 08:23:53.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ayun na po.

asr-008839
08:23:53.120 --> 08:23:54.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In-establish natin lump sum to.

asr-008840
08:23:54.480 --> 08:23:57.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, expenditures from lump sum appropriations.

asr-008841
08:23:57.400 --> 08:24:01.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Authorized for any purpose or for any department.

asr-008842
08:24:01.940 --> 08:24:03.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Authorized, meaning in-authorized ng Kongreso.

asr-008843
08:24:04.340 --> 08:24:11.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For any department, office, or agency in any annual General Appropriations Act or other act.

asr-008844
08:24:11.800 --> 08:24:14.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And from any fund of the national government.

asr-008845
08:24:14.760 --> 08:24:21.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Shall be made in accordance with a special budget to be approved by the President.

asr-008846
08:24:23.780 --> 08:24:24.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008847
08:24:24.100 --> 08:24:25.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ayun lang po.

asr-008848
08:24:25.180 --> 08:24:27.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gusto ko lang po ma-reconcile yung sagot nyo.

asr-008849
08:24:27.120 --> 08:24:36.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na sabi nyo, walang anumang involvement ng President from pagtanggap hanggang pag-evaluate hanggang pag-approve hanggang pag-release.

asr-008850
08:24:37.800 --> 08:24:47.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sabi po sa Admin Code, very clearly, expenditures from lump sum appropriations kinakailangan to be approved by the President.

asr-008851
08:24:49.400 --> 08:24:50.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me just elaborate.

asr-008852
08:24:50.640 --> 08:24:51.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit po ganyan yung batas?

asr-008853
08:24:53.700 --> 08:24:56.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Eh, ang intention po dyan, that's a safeguard.

asr-008854
08:24:57.120 --> 08:25:08.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nga may lump sum ka, hindi itemized dyan, in-approved ng Kongreso, as a safeguard against abuse, kailangan may pirma ng Presidente.

asr-008855
08:25:08.520 --> 08:25:11.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At alam naman natin, pag may pirma ng Presidente, hindi basta-basta yun.

asr-008856
08:25:11.900 --> 08:25:15.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pipirma ang Presidente sa anumang piece of paper.

asr-008857
08:25:16.400 --> 08:25:19.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong vetting, merong validation, verification, etc.

asr-008858
08:25:19.400 --> 08:25:24.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya, importante po yung approval ng Presidente.

asr-008859
08:25:25.960 --> 08:25:27.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano pong paliwanag?

asr-008860
08:25:27.120 --> 08:25:34.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Parang nilalabag ang probisyon ng Admin Code sa inyong kalakaran.

asr-008861
08:25:35.900 --> 08:25:46.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, meron po dito din sa parehong section po, also in Section 35, Chapter 5, Book 6 of EO 292,

asr-008862
08:25:46.820 --> 08:25:55.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung first line po ng last sentence sa first paragraph, which says, unless otherwise provided by law.

asr-008863
08:25:55.020 --> 08:25:56.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In this case po,

asr-008864
08:25:57.120 --> 08:26:16.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the GAA, through the special provision authorized by Congress, authorizes the DBM to issue the guidelines, criteria, and essentially administer the implementation of the lump sum funds.

asr-008865
08:26:16.040 --> 08:26:26.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Meron din po, relatedly, in Section 47 of EO 292, Section 47, Chapter 5, Book 6 of the same executive order,

asr-008866
08:26:27.120 --> 08:26:35.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it provides that the Department of Budget shall administer the lump sum funds appropriated in the General Appropriations Act,

asr-008867
08:26:35.940 --> 08:26:43.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: except as otherwise specified therein, including the issuance of treasury warrants, covering payments to implementing agencies and other creditors,

asr-008868
08:26:44.040 --> 08:26:45.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as may be authorized by the President.

asr-008869
08:26:45.840 --> 08:26:56.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, may dalawa po na nagsasabi na DBM po, para pong dine-delegate ng Pangulo yung authority sa DBM,

asr-008870
08:26:56.040 --> 08:26:58.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po sa implementation ng lump sum funds.

asr-008871
08:26:59.120 --> 08:27:02.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, let me take the second one you mentioned. May second provision kayo.

asr-008872
08:27:02.620 --> 08:27:08.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That only provides that the DBM administer the fund.

asr-008873
08:27:09.000 --> 08:27:09.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba? Administer.

asr-008874
08:27:10.040 --> 08:27:10.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sila, tama.

asr-008875
08:27:11.280 --> 08:27:14.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kayo, tatanggap, pwedeng mag-evaluate and so on.

asr-008876
08:27:14.280 --> 08:27:16.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero iba yung approval.

asr-008877
08:27:17.180 --> 08:27:20.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That doesn't talk about approval of the President.

asr-008878
08:27:20.760 --> 08:27:21.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, that takes it first.

asr-008879
08:27:21.740 --> 08:27:24.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi nyo, well, okay, unless otherwise,

asr-008880
08:27:25.160 --> 08:27:25.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: expressly,

asr-008881
08:27:26.040 --> 08:27:27.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: provided by law.

asr-008882
08:27:27.940 --> 08:27:29.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tignan po natin

asr-008883
08:27:29.060 --> 08:27:33.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang mga special provisions ng LGUs.

asr-008884
08:27:33.600 --> 08:27:34.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan na po.

asr-008885
08:27:34.400 --> 08:27:34.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan.

asr-008886
08:27:35.080 --> 08:27:38.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Financial assistance to LGUs.

asr-008887
08:27:39.160 --> 08:27:47.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The allocation of the financial assistance to LGUs shall be based on criteria to be developed by the DBM

asr-008888
08:27:47.240 --> 08:27:55.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in coordination with other relevant agencies taking into consideration LGUs adherence

asr-008889
08:27:56.040 --> 08:27:59.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to established governance standards.

asr-008890
08:27:59.060 --> 08:28:08.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Disbursement and utilization by LGUs shall be subject to the pertinent provisions of existing government procurement laws, etc.

asr-008891
08:28:08.920 --> 08:28:09.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: etc.

asr-008892
08:28:10.000 --> 08:28:13.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Disbursement and utilization, etc.

asr-008893
08:28:14.420 --> 08:28:19.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nowhere does it provide for approval.

asr-008894
08:28:19.320 --> 08:28:22.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, wala po.

asr-008895
08:28:22.720 --> 08:28:23.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala po.

asr-008896
08:28:23.200 --> 08:28:24.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Inaral po natin.

asr-008897
08:28:24.140 --> 08:28:24.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala.

asr-008898
08:28:24.680 --> 08:28:25.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Walang sinasabi.

asr-008899
08:28:26.040 --> 08:28:35.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na dinelegate ng Kongreso through express provision yung approval sa inyo sa DBM, I mean.

asr-008900
08:28:36.620 --> 08:28:51.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I hope the sponsor, I will no longer belabor this point, but I hope the sponsor will take note na baka, alam nyo, yung mga lump sum funds,

asr-008901
08:28:51.400 --> 08:28:55.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: isa-isang kine-question na sa Supreme Court, di ba?

asr-008902
08:28:55.520 --> 08:28:58.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung unprogrammed appropriations, may pending dyan.

asr-008903
08:29:00.980 --> 08:29:02.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung, ano pa nga ba?

asr-008904
08:29:04.920 --> 08:29:14.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung, eto, ngayon, baka mamaya, etong LGSF, isa ring unprogrammed appropriations, ay masama na rin.

asr-008905
08:29:15.460 --> 08:29:22.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At nakikita ko, merong mukhang merong paglabag sa kasalukuyang kalakaran.

asr-008906
08:29:22.120 --> 08:29:25.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Because, wala akong nakikitang batas.

asr-008907
08:29:25.520 --> 08:29:32.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That expressly delegates the approval to the DBM.

asr-008908
08:29:40.040 --> 08:29:51.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, on this point po, the DBM assures that currently, wala po, the approval lies with the DBM.

asr-008909
08:29:51.880 --> 08:29:52.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-008910
08:29:52.500 --> 08:29:55.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But, they submit to the wisdom of Congress.

asr-008911
08:29:55.520 --> 08:30:00.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we want to expressly state it, in the special provision

asr-008912
08:30:00.000 --> 08:30:01.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for LGSF

asr-008913
08:30:01.280 --> 08:30:03.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for LGSF for example

asr-008914
08:30:03.560 --> 08:30:05.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for 2027

asr-008915
08:30:05.380 --> 08:30:07.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we can expressly state

asr-008916
08:30:07.920 --> 08:30:10.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that the approval is required

asr-008917
08:30:10.080 --> 08:30:12.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: by for example

asr-008918
08:30:12.320 --> 08:30:14.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: by the president or if it

asr-008919
08:30:14.220 --> 08:30:15.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: lies with the DBM

asr-008920
08:30:15.180 --> 08:30:18.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because there are two different kinds

asr-008921
08:30:18.040 --> 08:30:20.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: there are two other kinds of lump sum funds

asr-008922
08:30:20.080 --> 08:30:22.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wherein that is expressly

asr-008923
08:30:22.340 --> 08:30:23.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: stated. The first

asr-008924
08:30:23.800 --> 08:30:25.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is the contingent funds and the second

asr-008925
08:30:25.620 --> 08:30:28.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: would be the NDRMF

asr-008926
08:30:28.740 --> 08:30:30.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: so the DBM submits

asr-008927
08:30:30.120 --> 08:30:32.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: if Congress so wishes

asr-008928
08:30:32.340 --> 08:30:33.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that for the GAA

asr-008929
08:30:33.920 --> 08:30:36.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 2027 we can modify the special provision

asr-008930
08:30:36.380 --> 08:30:38.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: okay and also

asr-008931
08:30:38.120 --> 08:30:40.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung dati meron ding express provision

asr-008932
08:30:40.120 --> 08:30:41.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on this on authorization

asr-008933
08:30:41.840 --> 08:30:44.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung unprogrammed

asr-008934
08:30:44.360 --> 08:30:46.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: appropriations which is also

asr-008935
08:30:46.120 --> 08:30:48.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: under lump sum funds. Meron ding express provision

asr-008936
08:30:48.420 --> 08:30:50.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: po yun. Specifically

asr-008937
08:30:50.220 --> 08:30:52.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: referring to section 35

asr-008938
08:30:52.440 --> 08:30:54.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: but anyway and also

asr-008939
08:30:54.200 --> 08:30:55.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi ng section 35

asr-008940
08:30:55.780 --> 08:30:58.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: unless otherwise expressly provided

asr-008941
08:30:58.480 --> 08:31:00.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: by law. So kailangan talaga

asr-008942
08:31:00.240 --> 08:31:02.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: merong express provision ng batas.

asr-008943
08:31:02.620 --> 08:31:04.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway noted na po yung sagot

asr-008944
08:31:04.460 --> 08:31:06.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that may address

asr-008945
08:31:06.440 --> 08:31:07.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the

asr-008946
08:31:07.580 --> 08:31:10.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: LGSF for 2027

asr-008947
08:31:10.720 --> 08:31:12.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: fiscal year 2027

asr-008948
08:31:12.320 --> 08:31:14.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: but not for the previous years. Yun lang po

asr-008949
08:31:14.360 --> 08:31:15.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang pinapoint out natin. Okay.

asr-008950
08:31:17.920 --> 08:31:20.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next topic. And hopefully

asr-008951
08:31:20.300 --> 08:31:22.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: this is more on a

asr-008952
08:31:22.240 --> 08:31:23.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: lighter note.

asr-008953
08:31:24.740 --> 08:31:25.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Yung

asr-008954
08:31:25.780 --> 08:31:25.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung

asr-008955
08:31:25.820 --> 08:31:27.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung

asr-008956
08:31:28.480 --> 08:31:30.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: miscellaneous personnel benefits fund.

asr-008957
08:31:30.780 --> 08:31:32.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan na po. Okay.

asr-008958
08:31:33.260 --> 08:31:34.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tignan po natin.

asr-008959
08:31:40.360 --> 08:31:42.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Una may historical na naman tayo.

asr-008960
08:31:42.660 --> 08:31:44.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Ito po yung again one

asr-008961
08:31:44.340 --> 08:31:46.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: decade of the MPBF.

asr-008962
08:31:47.600 --> 08:31:48.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung miscellaneous

asr-008963
08:31:48.680 --> 08:31:50.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: personnel benefits fund. Yan po

asr-008964
08:31:50.460 --> 08:31:52.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung lump sum fund na dito

asr-008965
08:31:52.360 --> 08:31:53.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pinagkukunan yung mga

asr-008966
08:31:53.740 --> 08:31:56.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dagdag sa sweldo,

asr-008967
08:31:56.100 --> 08:31:58.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dagdag sa allowance or benefits.

asr-008968
08:31:58.480 --> 08:32:00.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O kaya additional

asr-008969
08:32:00.000 --> 08:32:02.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: plantilla items

asr-008970
08:32:02.420 --> 08:32:03.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and so on and so forth.

asr-008971
08:32:04.360 --> 08:32:06.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So importante yan para sa ating

asr-008972
08:32:06.280 --> 08:32:08.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: personnel. Ngayon what has been the history

asr-008973
08:32:08.580 --> 08:32:09.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: over the years?

asr-008974
08:32:10.420 --> 08:32:11.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noong earlier

asr-008975
08:32:11.920 --> 08:32:13.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: years, 2016

