asr-009415
08:50:42.720 --> 08:50:48.000
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: The classroom shortage remains substantial.

asr-009416
08:50:49.280 --> 08:50:51.940
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Social protection deserves attention.

asr-009417
08:50:53.320 --> 08:51:03.760
