asr-009970
09:20:22.080 --> 09:20:30.320
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Against this backdrop, the real measure of 7.2 trillion budget is not its size,

asr-009971
09:20:31.040 --> 09:20:36.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: but the choices we make with the fiscal space that remains.

asr-009972
09:20:36.760 --> 09:20:40.740
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Whether we spend it efficiently,

asr-009973
09:20:41.480 --> 09:20:43.880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: direct it where it matters most,

asr-009974
09:20:44.540 --> 09:20:49.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: and invest it in ways that strengthen our capacity to grow.

asr-009975
09:20:50.880 --> 09:20:56.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I began by saying, show me your budget, I will show you your priorities.

asr-009976
09:20:57.780 --> 09:21:01.780
