asr-009977
09:21:02.460 --> 09:21:08.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ipakita natin kung saan napunta ang bawat pesong kaya pa nating pagpasyahan,

asr-009978
09:21:09.640 --> 09:21:11.460
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at ipakita natin ang resulta.

asr-009979
09:21:12.380 --> 09:21:17.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: The final test of this budget will not be found in these pages.

asr-009980
09:21:18.640 --> 09:21:21.260
