09:33:27.720 --> 09:33:39.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ginagawa tayong base, lunsaran at target. Sinusuportahan ito ng kasalukuyang budget proposal.

asr-010279
09:33:39.260 --> 09:33:55.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pang-apat, kinaltasan ang serbisyo habang pinapalaki ang ayuda. Funding for core education programs for teachers, for hospitals, health workers, social welfare and labor protection are cut.

asr-010280
09:33:55.100 --> 09:34:04.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: while AICS, MAIFIP and TUPAD remain the main channels for help at gusto pang dagdagan.

asr-010281
09:34:04.920 --> 09:34:22.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pang-lima, pinagdadamutan ang mga kawani ng gobyerno. After 17 years without an increase in personnel economic relief allowance, 2 million government employees are offered a mere 500 pesos a month increase.

asr-010282
09:34:22.880 --> 09:34:24.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dapat dagdagan ito.

asr-010283
09:34:25.100 --> 09:34:37.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At nasa posisyon ang administrasyon at si Pangulong Marcos para gumuhit sa kasaysayan sa pamamagitan ng significant, substantial increase sa PERA.

asr-010284
09:34:39.460 --> 09:34:51.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Speaker, hindi lang po tayo nag-offer ng analysis at critique. We come with specific demands.

asr-010285
