Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Itigil ang LGSF bilang presidential pork.

asr-010289
09:35:10.100 --> 09:35:15.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Isama na rin ang confidential and intelligence funds na mahigit 10 billion piso.

asr-010290
09:35:16.780 --> 09:35:24.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pangalawa, ibalik ang binawas at taasan ng pondo para sa edukasyon, kalusugan, pabahay at social welfare.

asr-010291
09:35:25.100 --> 09:35:28.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondo para sa serbisyo, hindi ayuda.

asr-010292
09:35:29.020 --> 09:35:34.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondo para sa dagdag na classroom at teacher items sa basic at higher education.

asr-010293
09:35:34.960 --> 09:35:42.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dagdag na hospital beds at health workers para maging regular ang mga job order and contract of service.

asr-010294
09:35:43.280 --> 09:35:52.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondohan ang 5.3 billion pesos na free higher education deficiency for 2026 and 2027.

asr-010295
09:35:53.480 --> 09:35:54.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pondohan ang

asr-010296
