Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And there must be regularization.

asr-010301
09:36:23.860 --> 09:36:24.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para sa mga job order.

asr-010302
09:36:24.900 --> 09:36:27.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At contract of service sa gobyerno.

asr-010303
09:36:27.920 --> 09:36:32.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pangapat, no to Pax Silica and US military presence on our soil.

asr-010304
09:36:32.940 --> 09:36:40.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We need an independent industrialization policy that builds our own industries and jobs.

asr-010305
09:36:40.820 --> 09:36:49.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And an independent defense policy that serves Filipino interests, not foreign strategy.

asr-010306
09:36:50.100 --> 09:36:52.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bilang pangwakas, Madam Speaker,

asr-010307
09:36:52.940 --> 09:36:58.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: these demands are urgent and they must be met.

asr-010308
09:36:58.940 --> 09:37:06.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But even if every one of these demands were granted, they would not change the fundamental character of this budget.

asr-010309
09:37:06.440 --> 09:37:11.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Debate on the budget is ultimately a debate on national policy.

asr-010310
09:37:11.420 --> 09:37:13.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The budget reflects policy.

asr-010311
09:37:13.900 --> 09:37:22.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As long as the policy is privatization, deregulation, liberalization, debt-driven patronage,

asr-010312
09:37:22.060 --> 09:37:29.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and dependence on a foreign power, the budget will reflect it, no matter how many line items we amend.

asr-010313
09:37:29.800 --> 09:37:37.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya ang laban ay hindi lamang laban sa loob ng General Appropriations Bill.

asr-010314
09:37:37.540 --> 09:37:41.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang laban ay para baguhin ang patakaran na pinagsisilbihan nito.

asr-010315
09:37:42.340 --> 09:37:51.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It is a fight for a budget that serves the Filipino people, not the oligarchs, not the dynasties, not a foreign power.

asr-010316
09:37:52.060 --> 09:38:02.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Budget para sa serbisyo, hindi para sa pork, para sa mamamayan, hindi para sa ilan, para sa bayan, hindi para sa dayuhan.

